e''s \"verified live\"/\n\"confirmed\" narrative tails (Flet upgrade regression pass, boot-route hang\nfix, #41-#44/#52/#63/#76 verification notes, icon_picker tail), condensed\nto current-state facts. Full detail preserved in CHANGE_HISTORY.md,\nincluding one genuinely missing entry for the select-field hover-highlight\nbug (#52 follow-up) that hadn''t been recorded there before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de1d6ff9f49c5bba1c57d5b186aab6e19ec0121c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/de1d6ff9f49c5bba1c57d5b186aab6e19ec0121c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/603561f3f478e430b0728a1f47cfbbca85e3f701","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/603561f3f478e430b0728a1f47cfbbca85e3f701","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDYwMzU2MWYzZjQ3OGU0MzBiMDcyOGExZjQ3Y2ZiYmNhODVlM2Y3MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f","sha":"a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f"}],"sha":"603561f3f478e430b0728a1f47cfbbca85e3f701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/603561f3f478e430b0728a1f47cfbbca85e3f701"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T02:43:05Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T02:43:05Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: compact AGENTS.md, move history to CHANGE_HISTORY.md and usage to README.md\n\nAGENTS.md had grown to 5124 lines with dated investigation narratives mixed\ninto current-state architecture docs. Condensed issue-by-issue \"found live/\nfixed/verified\" sagas down to brief current-state facts, moved full\nnarratives into CHANGE_HISTORY.md, and moved operational/usage instructions\n(ports reference, migrations, run.ps1/run.sh build/preview/dev-mode menu)\ninto README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cb554a30c89ea5a2e646a0fd5fe75cd1bf360cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/0cb554a30c89ea5a2e646a0fd5fe75cd1bf360cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGEyYzQzYjc4OTkxMWJkMzdjMDAwMTlhZDc1MjFkOWQ4NDVjNTc1NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0","sha":"0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0"}],"sha":"a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a2c43b789911bd37c00019ad7521d9d845c5756f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:00:55Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:00:55Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): correct ModalHeader to M3 Full-screen dialog spec (#85)\n\nModals are M3 Full-screen dialogs, not module drill-down screens -\nissue #83''s back+Home header was the wrong component. Close (X) icon\nreplaces the back arrow, a new set_action() registers the primary\naction as a trailing text button (56dp header, not 64dp - the real\ndialog spec value) instead of a body-level Submit button. Body is now\npadded 24dp and capped to 560dp, centered, without breaking mobile\nwidths. totp''s two-button flow and the discard-confirmation dialog are\ndeliberately left as-is per explicit decision.\n\nCloses #85","tree":{"sha":"765831c6f0aa66545894ab0e2ca8032c3b0982e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/765831c6f0aa66545894ab0e2ca8032c3b0982e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDBjOGE2ZTY0MDQyZjg5ZGZlZDMyNDMwZTIyMTM0ZDcyODQ3YzIxYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914","sha":"c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914"}],"sha":"0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/0c8a6e64042f89dfed32430e22134d72847c21c0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:21:23Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:21:23Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"style(frontend): full-rounded (pill) border on every search bar (#84)\n\nThe shared SearchBar component used border_radius=10, matching regular\nform fields, instead of a stadium/pill shape - M3''s own SearchBar\ncomponent spec. Changed to half the field''s fixed height (24). Home''s\nnative ft.SearchBar was already fully-rounded by Material 3''s own\ndefault shape, confirmed live, no change needed there.\n\nCloses #84","tree":{"sha":"dcdbe7ba488107672c971a050057f39d6abbe7f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/dcdbe7ba488107672c971a050057f39d6abbe7f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGMxYmRkMWU0Y2RiYzYxZDE0ZTE3ZjFjNWVkOTViZGMwNmIyZTQ5MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6","sha":"96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6"}],"sha":"c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c1bdd1e4cdbc61d14e17f1c5ed95bdc06b2e4914"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T04:40:43Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T04:40:43Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): standardize AppBar to M3 Small app bar spec (#83)\n\nEvery header hardcoded Material 2''s center_title=True and never set\ntoolbar_height (defaulting to Flutter''s 56dp instead of M3''s 64dp).\nModuleHeader now shows a two-line module-name/page-title block,\nstart-aligned; ModalHeader''s Close icon is now a standard back arrow\nwith a new Home action. Fixed a mislabeled SEARCH icon that actually\nnavigated home. Scroll-color-fill and a flexible Medium/Large app bar\nare skipped - confirmed ft.AppBar has no support for either.\n\nCloses #83","tree":{"sha":"772a7a95cb00856e0066f519494b1420ea26ca2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/772a7a95cb00856e0066f519494b1420ea26ca2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDk2YTNiM2M4OTkzMjI0Mjk5NDgxN2VjODZhMTNiYmEyZTkwYTNkYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0","sha":"537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0"}],"sha":"96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/96a3b3c89932242994817ec86a13bba2e90a3db6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T03:57:56Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T03:57:56Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): default List per-field filter to on (#82)\n\nListFilter required \"filter\": True per field while TableFilter has\nbeen opt-out-by-default since issue #10 - harmless while List was a\ncurated pilot, but issue #81 made List the app-wide default view\nreusing Table''s own field lists, so most fields never got the flag\nadded and the List view showed almost no filters. Now uses the same\nfield.get(\"filter\", True) is not False rule as Table, with hidden\nfields excluded (a gap Table''s own filter didn''t have either). Sort\nstays opt-in, unchanged.\n\nCloses #82","tree":{"sha":"078895a3a07f39f8517c9c9c59fdae2241291b14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/078895a3a07f39f8517c9c9c59fdae2241291b14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDUzNzA0M2Q3NmJkMGIzZTEyZTdiZGE4ZWZlMDY4ZjBhZmQ5MmFhYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3","sha":"75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3"}],"sha":"537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/537043d76bd0b3e12e7bda8efe068f0afd92aab0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T03:31:39Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T03:31:39Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): make List/ViewToggle the app-wide default table view (#81)\n\nLayout.get() no longer drops fields with no explicit \"position\" -\nauto-assigns leading/title/subtitle/overflow by field order, with\noverflow fields shown via M3''s Expand & collapse pattern. Added\ncustom_param support to List and per-field link navigation to Tiles\n(both previously Table-only), and ViewToggle.apply_custom_param() so a\nscreen filter survives a List<->Table switch. Rolled ViewToggle out to\n19 screens that previously built Table(...) directly.\n\nCloses #81","tree":{"sha":"177eec306703ad3888a956d07fa560355120f6cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/177eec306703ad3888a956d07fa560355120f6cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDc1ZGZmY2ExY2Y5OGRlNTZhOWYwMTZiODc5Zjc1ZTI5MzgxYzg3ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269","sha":"838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269"}],"sha":"75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/75dffca1cf98de56a9f016b879f75e29381c87e3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T02:42:17Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T02:42:17Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: record live verification of issue #80''s logout log-clear round trip\n\nConfirmed with a real logged-in session: logout truncated only that\nsession''s own per-client log file (23015 -> 45 bytes) while two other\nconcurrent sessions'' log files were untouched, closing the one gap\nleft open after #80 was closed.","tree":{"sha":"b3995786b3792b202ce308394beb95ed8eaa9e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/b3995786b3792b202ce308394beb95ed8eaa9e3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDgzOGJkNTM1OTJiYTkxZWUwZmRmMjJiNzNkMDIzOTc1ZGI4NDUyNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815","sha":"85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815"}],"sha":"838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/838bd53592ba91ee0fdf22b73d023975db845269"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T02:30:45Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T02:30:45Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: mark issue #80 closed in tracked-issues table\n\nClosed on GitHub via the previous commit''s Closes #80 trailer.","tree":{"sha":"99200250c9b87f360bd22257221430074f025953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/99200250c9b87f360bd22257221430074f025953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDg1MDE0ZmZjM2U4NjFmMTExNGNkNmNmZDViZTYwODIzM2UyYzQ4MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b","sha":"71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b"}],"sha":"85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/85014ffc3e861f1114cd6cfd5be608233e2c4815"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T02:30:15Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T02:30:15Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): restrict Troubleshooting to desktop/mobile, redact credentials from logs, scope logging per client session (#80)\n\nThe Troubleshooting page (and its login/user-menu entry points) is now\nhidden and its route redirected on web, matching issue #36''s existing\nServer Configuration restriction - live-verified after discovering the\nrunning container needed a restart to pick up source changes.\n\nWhile verifying, found utils/http_client.py was printing raw\npasswords, TOTP codes/secrets, tokens, and session cookie values into\nthe app log on every platform - a real credential leak, worse on web\nwhere the log used to be one process-global buffer/file shared by\nevery concurrent session. Added utils/log_redact.py and wired it into\nevery request/response logging call site (http_client.py,\ncomponents/form/form.py, the login/password/token flows).\n\nRather than just hide the log viewer on web, redesigned\nutils/app_logger.py to bucket every log line by client_id instead of\none shared buffer - each web session now gets its own in-memory\nbuffer and its own on-disk file under storage/data/sessions/, mirroring\nthe existing per-client session-file convention. This lets logout\nsafely clear a session''s own logs on every platform, not just\ndesktop/mobile, fully satisfying the issue''s own \"auto-clear on\nlogout\" requirement.\n\nCloses #80","tree":{"sha":"1fb7439e7f773bd5706021157a491b70cd79ca88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/1fb7439e7f773bd5706021157a491b70cd79ca88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDcxYjUzMTY3YmYwMjI1NWEzYWI4MTdlMGRlMmQ2YWI5NjE5MzdkOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5","sha":"6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5"}],"sha":"71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/71b53167bf02255a3ab817e0de2d6ab961937d9b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:01:47Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:01:47Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: record issue #50 instrumentation findings and confirmed cause\n\nRecords what the pan-handler instrumentation actually proved (the header\nStack was replaced on every drag tick), the second defect found and fixed\n(manually_resized set only on pan_end), and - importantly - what was NOT\nestablished: the second-drag symptom was never reproduced, so #50 stays\nopen pending real physical-drag verification.\n\nAlso retracts an incorrect intermediate reading of mine, so the next pass\ndoesn''t build on it: pan-event counts cannot be measured with CDP drags,\nbecause the count tracks how many mouseMoved events CDP emits rather than\nhow many the gesture survives.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d07f042b8b6725aae3ec28be4c4ec982b4dc3947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/d07f042b8b6725aae3ec28be4c4ec982b4dc3947"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDY1NjdiODI0NDk0OTc2M2FjMThkYTM0Yzk5N2M2NDhlNmQwNTU4ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc","sha":"e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc"}],"sha":"6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6567b8244949763ac18da34c997c648e6d0558e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:00:52Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:00:52Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(table): stop replacing the header Stack on every resize drag tick (#50)\n\nInstrumented the pan handlers and read the live logs first, as the issue\nrequired. That confirmed the documented prime suspect: every drag tick\nrebuilds the header, and _build_header_with_resize_overlay() returned a\nbrand-new ft.Stack each time, so the Stack''s control id changed on every\nsingle tick (1814 -> 2391 -> 2553 -> 2703 ...). The resize handles are\ncached, but caching them cannot help on its own - a widget''s place in the\ntree is part of its client-side identity, so the GestureDetector carrying\nthe in-flight pan was being re-parented under the user''s pointer.\n\nNow one Stack is reused for the table''s lifetime and only controls[0]\n(the header''s DataTable) is swapped per tick. Logs confirm the Stack id\nis stable across rebuilds.\n\nAlso moved `manually_resized = True` from _on_pan_end into handle_drag(),\nwhere the widths actually change: if a rebuild ever costs us the closing\npan_end event, the flag would never be set and the next load() would\nsilently discard the user''s resize by recomputing auto-fit widths.\n\nNOT claimed as a verified fix for the reported symptom: the second-drag\nfailure could not be reproduced here - synthetic/CDP drags succeeded both\nbefore and after - and visual confirmation was blocked by the browser\nwindow being backgrounded (Flutter does not paint a hidden tab, which\nalso explains a run of blank screenshots). Issue #50 stays open pending\nreal physical-drag verification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ac1e4da397dbbf14a6271b7e4a239aaed4b5d2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/1ac1e4da397dbbf14a6271b7e4a239aaed4b5d2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGUxYTQ5NGUyZjU4ZjM0ZTI4MTc2NDk1NGMyNjM5MThkNTllYjI4ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd","sha":"5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd"}],"sha":"e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e1a494e2f58f34e281764954c263918d59eb28fc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:00:31Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:00:31Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"style: restore original line endings mangled by commit 7d84d17\n\nPython''s pathlib.write_text() translates \\n to \\r\\n on Windows, so the\n#71/#79 pass silently rewrote six files'' line endings (four LF->CRLF,\ntwo CRLF->LF). Content was correct but every line showed as changed,\nwhich is why that commit reported 3356/3155 instead of a reviewable\ndiff, and it would have polluted git blame.\n\nNo content change whatsoever - `git diff --ignore-all-space` between\nthis commit and its parent is empty for every file touched here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"975e307dd6c9a69740a3e330ae74f19ae639d43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/975e307dd6c9a69740a3e330ae74f19ae639d43f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDViZTkyYzEzMzFjNjQwOTNjZjBmOTlhMDRkNGEwODVhOGRmZGQ5Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135","sha":"665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135"}],"sha":"5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5be92c1331c64093cf0f99a04d4a085a8dfdd9cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T07:35:35Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T07:35:35Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): restore M3 48dp touch targets app-wide (#76)\n\nReverts the compact 32dp/24px sizing decisions from issues #21/#53/#63\nback to Material 3''s 48dp minimum touch target, after live testing on a\nreal iPad/iPhone (issue #75) found the compact sizing too small to\ncomfortably tap.\n\nAdds shared TOUCH_TARGET_SIZE/TOUCH_TARGET_RADIUS constants in\nbutton.py and TOOLBAR_HEIGHT in table/toolbar.py, so every\ntoolbar/footer/search-bar button sizes off one definition instead of\neach file duplicating its own 32/16 pair - restoring standard sizing\n(or retuning it later) now needs one edit, not nine.\n\nCloses #76\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31ab76838253baeb410135729072ee0670bef434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/31ab76838253baeb410135729072ee0670bef434"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDY2NWQwYTdlM2FkNmViZmFkYzhhZmQ2ZDBlNGEyNTczZDBhYzIxMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088","sha":"7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088"}],"sha":"665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/665d0a7e3ad6ebfadc8afd6d0e4a2573d0ac2135"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T07:28:23Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T07:28:23Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): outlined M3 form fields + select first-click bug (#71, #79)\n\nSwitches every form field type (input/select/date/label/icon_picker)\nfrom #53''s filled M3 style to outlined (border=OUTLINE, no fill),\nvia shared constants in input.py so no field type hardcodes its own\npadding/radius/helper style again.\n\nRoot-caused and fixed the two real bugs found along the way, after\nseveral wrong hypotheses (recorded in CHANGE_HISTORY.md so they aren''t\nretried):\n\n- #79 (clipped floating labels): content_padding vertical was\n  hardcoded to 8 on every field type; Flutter''s outlined-field default\n  is 20, and the label genuinely had nowhere to go on OUTLINE borders.\n  icon_picker.py - the one field type that never set content_padding -\n  was also the one field type never reported as clipping, which is\n  what identified the real cause.\n\n- #71 (first click via the text region did nothing): SelectForm''s own\n  _on_focus handler pushed an update() patch to the client while the\n  menu overlay was still opening, tearing the overlay down and losing\n  the pending tap. Removed the handler (and the matching one from\n  input/date/label) - Flutter/M3 already recolours focus state natively.\n\nSimplified select.py from ~435 to ~215 lines, deleting every workaround\nthat turned out to be causing a bug rather than fixing one:\n_build_dropdown, _on_select, a wrapping Container, _safe_container_update,\na delayed post-mount refresh nudge, and a cascading-select mechanism\n(depends_on/refresh_with_values) confirmed unused by any screen in the app.\n\nAdded AGENTS.md''s \"Working Principle - Think Twice Before Workarounds\non Standard Flet Components\" and matching notes in the planner/coder\nskills, so future issues/implementations diagnose root causes before\nadding custom rebuild/refresh/patch machinery around stock controls.\n\nCloses #71\nCloses #79\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"85985df115bd5f3ad1ef94020a9c78cb8ae6d783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/85985df115bd5f3ad1ef94020a9c78cb8ae6d783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDdkODRkMTdlZmUwZjhjZjQxYTYzNzQ2MzE1ZjA2MmY1ZjNhYzgwODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722","sha":"ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722"}],"sha":"7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/7d84d17efe0f8cf41a63746315f062f5f3ac8088"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T10:34:03Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T10:34:03Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): mobile Safari picker blur-cancel + gallery UX improvements (#77)\n\nFilePicker.pick_files()''s cancel_upload_on_window_blur defaults to True -\na desktop-style \"user switched away = cancel\" signal that misfires on\nmobile Safari, where opening any native picker always blurs the\nunderlying page as the OS takes over the screen. Set to False on the\nscan flow''s pick_files() call.\n\nAlso: added an explicit OK button to the manual-entry dialog (alongside\nCancel/Enter), and cancelling Gallery when opened from the live-camera\nview now returns to the camera instead of falling to manual entry.","tree":{"sha":"47e60de589087dd8883e0dc28a14593a2d38ed97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/47e60de589087dd8883e0dc28a14593a2d38ed97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGVlMjMzNWUzNDJmY2I5YzExMmUyZWM2NmEyM2I4NzJlZjQyODE3MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49","sha":"9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49"}],"sha":"ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ee2335e342fcb9c112e2ec66a23b872ef4281722"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T10:23:22Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T10:23:22Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): Gallery picker race condition in live-camera scan view (#77)\n\n_pick_photo() created/registered the FilePicker service and immediately\ncalled pick_files() in the same handler - page.update() doesn''t wait for\nthe client to process the new service before the next line tries to use\nit, a real race that showed up as a black screen with a stuck loader and\nno picker ever opening. Extracted _ensure_file_picker_registered() and\ncall it early from _open_camera(), well before the camera even finishes\ninitializing, so the service has plenty of round-trip time before Gallery\ncould realistically be tapped.","tree":{"sha":"f0c3e8b3436da9434983c730e4ec0ec8d16ec07b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/f0c3e8b3436da9434983c730e4ec0ec8d16ec07b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDk0NzhhOGIxNGUyMmUzZWQyYWZjZTIwYTAwZDBhZGI3NWY1MmFlNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0","sha":"136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0"}],"sha":"9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/9478a8b14e22e3ed2afce20a00d0adb75f52ae49"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T10:16:13Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T10:16:13Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): mobile UI fixes, dev-tooling QR bugs, and camera scan fixes (#73, #77)\n\nMultiple fixes from real-device (mobile Safari, iPad/iPhone) and\ndev-tooling testing this session:\n\n- Remove page.adaptive=True (and per-control adaptive=True echoes) that\n  made TextField fields render as Cupertino on iOS Safari next to an\n  always-Material Dropdown - mismatched heights, missing labels, wrong\n  icon slots (#73)\n- Bundle Montserrat/Lato fonts locally instead of fetching from\n  fonts.gstatic.com at runtime, removing a client-side external\n  dependency\n- Fix a real blocking-event-loop bug: main.py called\n  storage.client_data.is_active() synchronously, freezing Flet''s\n  single-threaded server for every connecting client whenever that HTTP\n  call was slow. Wrapped in asyncio.to_thread, matching senar''s own\n  pattern. Also fixed http_client.py''s timeout=300000 units bug\n  (requests'' timeout is in seconds, not milliseconds - was ~83 hours)\n- frontend/run.ps1: fix the dev-mode QR-scan flow (--android/--ios)\n  launching via Start-Process instead of the `&` call operator, since\n  invoking it inside a function whose result feeds an `if` condition was\n  redirecting the child process''s stdout through a pipe (breaking\n  Python''s console-encoding path for the printed QR)\n- Camera scan (#77): detect and clearly message an insecure (non-HTTPS)\n  web origin instead of a misleading \"no camera detected\" (getUserMedia\n  is silently refused by browsers on plain HTTP); move the camera-switch\n  button beside Gallery instead of the top bar; fix the live camera\n  preview rendering at a small fixed size via Stack''s missing\n  fit=StackFit.EXPAND; fix the Gallery photo picker doing nothing when\n  opened from the live-camera view (a user-gesture-chain ordering bug -\n  the picker must be triggered before any other awaited work)\n- README.md: document the Wi-Fi-only LAN-access constraint and the\n  HTTPS requirement for camera scanning\n\nCloses #73\nCloses #77","tree":{"sha":"fdf1f62cb905564bfe945d3b0eaf8b92f06294a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/fdf1f62cb905564bfe945d3b0eaf8b92f06294a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDEzNmYzM2E1OGRjNGNjM2E4OWU0NzAyNjQ3NzI5ZjI5ZDNjMjQ3YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554","sha":"4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554"}],"sha":"136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/136f33a58dc4cc3a89e4702647729f29d3c247c0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T09:44:46Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T09:44:46Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): full-screen camera scanner UX + scan-line jitter fix (#64)\n\nReplaces the small AlertDialog camera view with a full-screen\nborderless overlay (translucent icon buttons floating over the feed:\nclose, camera-switch, gallery), drops \"Enter Manually\" while a camera\nis active, and fixes scan-line stutter by driving the bounce off\nContainer.on_animation_end instead of an asyncio.sleep loop that could\ndesync from the client''s actual animation timing.","tree":{"sha":"01a48d29dd1da74183edf02db0163e577f1223e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/01a48d29dd1da74183edf02db0163e577f1223e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDQyOTBkNGI3NWYwMzEyM2ViZDdhY2M4MGZmNGVjYTExYzgyMDY1NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207","sha":"a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207"}],"sha":"4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4290d4b75f03123ebd7acc80ff4eca11c8206554"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T09:07:58Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T09:07:58Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): Android upload-keystore signing + APK install/nginx fixes\n\nSigning setup:\n- Adds a \"Generate Android upload keystore\" option (21) to run.ps1/run.sh,\n  generating a gitignored frontend/key/upload-keystore.jks via a\n  non-interactive keytool call, password sourced from .env.\n- pyproject.toml''s [tool.flet.android.signing] holds only the non-secret\n  key_alias - key_store is deliberately NOT set there, since a relative\n  path resolves against the generated Flutter scaffold''s app module dir,\n  not this project directory (confirmed via a real failed build:\n  Gradle''s validateSigningRelease couldn''t find the keystore). Both\n  scripts instead export FLET_ANDROID_SIGNING_KEY_STORE as an absolute\n  path computed at build time, alongside the store/key passwords loaded\n  from .env.\n- Verified live: a real signed release APK was built and its actual\n  signing certificate confirmed (via apksigner) to match the generated\n  keystore, not a debug-key fallback.\n\nAPK install convenience:\n- preview-apk (option 13) now detects Android''s\n  INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE (hit switching a device''s existing\n  debug/unsigned install to this new signed build) and offers to\n  uninstall + retry, rather than just failing with no explanation.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Records a Windows/Podman networking incident found live this session:\n  after heavy container-restart churn (including a full wsl --shutdown),\n  Podman''s port-forwarder can silently fail to re-register a host\n  listener for one service''s published ports (nginx''s 8001/5001) while\n  another service''s (frontend''s 8000) comes back fine - fixed by\n  restarting just the affected container, not the whole stack/machine.","tree":{"sha":"8e4b6ba2f7cc6056ae81fe1936319209e1105111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/8e4b6ba2f7cc6056ae81fe1936319209e1105111"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGEzNDcwMjcyM2U1ZjgzYTliZDVjMThlNDAwZmJhZGUyYjU4MmIyMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f","sha":"dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f"}],"sha":"a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a34702723e5f83a9bd5c18e400fbade2b582b207"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T08:29:01Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T08:29:01Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend,infra): Android runtime crashes, nginx stale-DNS, button sizing (#73, #74)\n\nThree independent fixes landed together this session:\n\n- Button.build()''s sized IconButton branch never set size_constraints,\n  so Flutter''s default ~40-48dp tap-target region could overflow a\n  toolbar''s fixed-height row on mobile - same class of bug already\n  fixed for ScanInput/SearchBar (issue #52). Addresses #73''s toolbar/\n  footer/submit-button misalignment findings.\n\n- nginx''s upstream {} blocks resolved frontend/backend hostnames once\n  at worker startup and never re-resolved, so restarting either\n  container alone left nginx sending traffic to a dead IP until nginx\n  itself was restarted too. Fixed with an explicit resolver directive\n  (read from the container''s own /etc/resolv.conf) plus variable-based\n  proxy_pass, which nginx does re-resolve.\n\n- main.py''s sys.stdout.reconfigure() crashed the Android APK at import\n  time (Android''s stdout has no such method), and\n  persistence.py''s native store path guessed ~/.local/share, which\n  resolves to an unwritable root on Android. Fixed by guarding the\n  reconfigure() call and preferring FLET_APP_STORAGE_DATA (the Flet\n  runtime''s own writable app-data path) for session storage. Also adds\n  the CAMERA permission needed by flet-camera''s live scan.\n\nCloses #74","tree":{"sha":"f31884a88d11657de2545a9b53854dd998f9da57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/f31884a88d11657de2545a9b53854dd998f9da57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGRjYjVmYmMwOWQ1MmQ0NjYwM2ZhMWE5OWNkNjVmNzMwYmRkY2U2M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92","sha":"277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92"}],"sha":"dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dcb5fbc09d52d46603fa1a99cd65f730bddce63f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T05:37:25Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T05:37:25Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(infra): add nginx passthrough layer for backend/frontend (#69)\n\nAdds nginx as an additive reverse-proxy layer with 4 new listeners\n(8001/8444 -> frontend, 5001/5444 -> backend), each a straight 1:1\nforward - existing service ports stay published unchanged for direct\ndebugging, per explicit design decision. SSL ports use stream-level\nTCP passthrough since both services already terminate their own TLS.\nexpose-lan.ps1/sh now default to only the nginx ports and read them\nfrom .env instead of hardcoding. Fixed a real IPv6/wget healthcheck\nbug (localhost resolves to ::1, nginx isn''t listening on it) found\nduring live verification.\n\nCloses #69\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e821b81e80197510a73fc956484516d4270f0fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/e821b81e80197510a73fc956484516d4270f0fcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDI3N2UyYzhlY2YzNTUwYzZjM2IwMjRmZDdiYjIyN2YxYjc4M2ViOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127","sha":"6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127"}],"sha":"277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/277e2c8ecf3550c6c3b024fd7bb227f1b783eb92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T05:36:48Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T05:36:48Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): camera scan freeze + jank on live scan-line (#64)\n\n_on_stream_image blocked the asyncio event loop with a synchronous\npyzbar decode, starving the scan-line animation''s scheduled updates\n(too fast/stuck). camera.initialize()/get_available_cameras() had no\ntimeout, so a hang left the dialog stuck on \"Starting camera...\"\nforever. Moved decode to a worker thread via asyncio.to_thread and\nadded a 10s timeout with graceful fallback to the existing error UI.\n\nRefs #64\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86bc90c1df2f0b11fa26fc364e9b0b92780f942c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/86bc90c1df2f0b11fa26fc364e9b0b92780f942c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDZhYWRiMzQwYjFlMTc1YmRlY2M2YmQwNDYzMWE2YTA0MDNkM2YxMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1","sha":"e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1"}],"sha":"6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6aadb340b1e175bdecc6bd04631a6a0403d3f127"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T03:37:38Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T03:37:38Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs(frontend): root-cause issue #71 as an upstream Flutter limitation (#71)\n\nLive server-log instrumentation (with a real user reproducing the bug)\nproved on_select never fires on the failing click - the event is never\ndispatched from the Flutter client, so no Python fix could work. Root\ncause: DropdownMenu''s first tap after the text field gains focus is\nconsumed by Flutter''s own focus-settling handshake. Documented as a\nknown limitation per user decision; kept the more-robust rebuild-based\non_select for selections that do reach the server.\n\nRefs #71\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"075a78b66c9d2dd759a0b9241428a0b3de6cc622","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/075a78b66c9d2dd759a0b9241428a0b3de6cc622"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGU2OGFhNzY1YWM4ZjEyMTk4YTg5YTNlZDMyNGRjN2FmZWU2YmEzYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/01784b26ddc725649096f1132975de1c58a92d05","sha":"01784b26ddc725649096f1132975de1c58a92d05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/01784b26ddc725649096f1132975de1c58a92d05"}],"sha":"e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e68aa765ac8f12198a89a3ed324dc7afee6ba3a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9530757?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yohannaftali/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yohannaftali/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yohannaftali/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yohannaftali/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali","id":9530757,"login":"yohannaftali","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MzA3NTc=","organiz