9c9b8e449f83ffaee7f16f92f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:06:13Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T09:06:13Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(table): match date-formatted columns by displayed text in filter (#61)\n\nPer-column filter used to LIKE a date column''s raw ISO value, so typing\n\"27\" or \"jul\" often matched nothing. Adds a date_fields option to\napply_column_filters that wraps the column in DATE_FORMAT(col, ''%d %b\n%Y'') - mirroring the frontend''s own display format - before matching.\nWired end-to-end on receiving_repository''s header list (stock_in/index),\nalso fixing a live no-op where that field''s filter UI already existed\nbut the backend never applied it.\n\nCloses #61","tree":{"sha":"84438b4c006154058fe6e608ab69c7a27c8ef34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/84438b4c006154058fe6e608ab69c7a27c8ef34c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/4cc7d506d9719e9c9b8e449f83ffaee7f16f92f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/4cc7d506d9719e9c9b8e449f83ffaee7f16f92f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDRjYzdkNTA2ZDk3MTllOWM5YjhlNDQ5ZjgzZmZhZWU3ZjE2ZjkyZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dcb58993ba1b5f6682c1047378a9622968466535","sha":"dcb58993ba1b5f6682c1047378a9622968466535","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dcb58993ba1b5f6682c1047378a9622968466535"}],"sha":"4cc7d506d9719e9c9b8e449f83ffaee7f16f92f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4cc7d506d9719e9c9b8e4