simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/36ef57de5886c1728858899e36bf373223f33141"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/935499a867dc6da50e206aa1af539bff6bb7bedf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T07:20:18Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T07:20:18Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): restore TOTP copy-secret button (#59)\n\nPage.set_clipboard was removed in Flet 0.85 - clipboard access now\ngoes through the ft.Clipboard service, lazily registered the same\nway FilePicker already is in components/table/menu.py.\n\nCloses #59","tree":{"sha":"9c3fb6a56dd56e4267db8a6655982e38dfeba65a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/9c3fb6a56dd56e4267db8a6655982e38dfeba65a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/935499a867dc6da50e206aa1af539bff6bb7bedf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/935499a867dc6da50e206aa1af539bff6bb7bedf","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDkzNTQ5OWE4NjdkYzZkYTUwZTIwNmFhMWFmNTM5YmZmNmJiN2JlZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14","sha":"5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14"}],"sha":"935499a867dc6da50e206aa1af539bff6bb7bedf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/935499a867dc6da50e206aa1af539bff6bb7bedf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T06:56:35Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T06:56:35Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: close #58, track issue #59 (TOTP copy-secret clipboard API bug)\n\nIssue #58 closed on GitHub after live end-to-end verification. Issue\n#59 filed for a new bug found in the same modal: on_copy_secret_click\ncalls the removed Page.set_clipboard API instead of Flet 0.85''s\nft.Clipboard service.","tree":{"sha":"a0e330496649d581912f9013cd90eb4612b7eac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/a0e330496649d581912f9013cd90eb4612b7eac1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDVmMTlhMTA5MDU4NDAwNmVlNjEwZGI4NTEzNWEzN2NlMjgzOGZmMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6","sha":"ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6"}],"sha":"5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5f19a1090584006ee610db85135a37ce2838ff14"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T06:52:21Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T06:52:21Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): declare qrcode/pypng as real dependencies (#58)\n\npages/modals/totp/index.py builds its QR via\nqrcode.image.pure.PyPNGImage, which needs the optional pypng package -\nnot installed, and qrcode itself was never actually declared in\npyproject.toml (only present in the local uv.lock as an incidental\ntransitive resolution). Added both explicitly so a fresh uv sync/lock\nresolves them correctly. Verified end-to-end: generated a QR, computed\na valid TOTP code from the returned secret, and confirmed\ncall_change_totp accepted and persisted it.\n\nCloses #58","tree":{"sha":"38e264b7b08e24590377f24522c398c5134f1c3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/38e264b7b08e24590377f24522c398c5134f1c3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGVlNzJiNjk3ODY3YzU3ODg2OWNhZWQyNmY1MzAzNjVjMWNkY2UxYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8","sha":"003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8"}],"sha":"ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ee72b697867c578869caed26f530365c1cdce1c6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T06:16:50Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T06:16:50Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): bring List to feature parity with Table (#55)\n\nAdd a lazy-load/pagination-mode footer (reusing Table''s TableFooter\nunmodified - List already carries the same attribute names it duck-\ntypes on), per-field search, and true multi-column sort to List, all\nwired against the existing table_query.py backend contract with no\nbackend changes. Each filterable field gets Table''s own leading\nfilter-icon/trailing clear-icon pair, and each sortable field gets its\nown none->ASC->DESC->none toggle button, appending as an additional\nsort key rather than replacing - same UX and wire format as Table''s\nown header sort icons.\n\nstock_in/index now uses List as its first real consumer (date/\ndescription/supplier_name mapped to leading/title/subtitle, all\nfilterable and sortable). Wiring this up surfaced a real gap: List\nnever applied a field''s \"format\" (e.g. \"date\") the way Table''s cells\ndo, so dates rendered as raw ISO strings - fixed by threading \"format\"\nthrough Layout and reusing Table''s same formatter dispatch in Tiles.\n\nVerified live throughout: filter narrowing record counts with the\nfooter updating to match, both sort directions reordering rows,\nmulti-column sort-fields sent in click-priority order, lazy-load\nfetching subsequent pages on scroll, and row click navigating to the\ncorrect edit screen.\n\nCloses #55","tree":{"sha":"325d06250a7f95ce442ae31cdd643dad849299b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/325d06250a7f95ce442ae31cdd643dad849299b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDAwMzgwOTc1NGQzOTBmMWFhOGZiODk5ZTZiMzc2OTZkNTQ0ZWU5ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d","sha":"8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d"}],"sha":"003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/003809754d390f1aa8fb899e6b37696d544ee9d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T04:51:33Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T04:51:33Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: track issue #54 (table input cell padding remnant) and close out #53\n\nIssue #54 filed as a deprioritized follow-up bug for #53 - table\neditable input/textarea cells still show residual padding/border\nin at least one screen despite the collapsed=True fix, and the\ndiscrepancy with an earlier flush verification needs a clean repro\nbefore another attempt.","tree":{"sha":"7f282de214aeca3c2f1c8b48a72fa2687cada4ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/7f282de214aeca3c2f1c8b48a72fa2687cada4ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDgxODBkZTJkYTdhOTQzNzljMjJlZWM2OWE0MWMxZDU3YWU0NzY5MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df","sha":"b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df"}],"sha":"8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8180de2da7a94379c22eec69a41c1d57ae47691d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T04:50:09Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T04:50:09Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): borderless M3 filled inputs across forms and tables (#53)\n\nReplace outlined-border inputs app-wide with M3-spec filled fields:\nconstant SURFACE_CONTAINER_HIGHEST fill, ON_SURFACE text, and a\nbottom active-indicator border that turns PRIMARY on focus (only the\nlabel/indicator swap, not the fill - corrected after checking the\nreal M3 spec against an initial custom background-swap design).\nSelect fields get square corners; table editable cells get no\nborder/padding at all and fill flush edge-to-edge (Google\nSheets-style), since the table grid already delineates each cell.\nAlso: fixed the scan button''s hover highlight bleeding into its\nselect''s dropdown arrow (#52 follow-up) by moving it out of the\nDropdown''s own decoration; added optional QR scan support to plain\ntext inputs; date field''s trailing icon now shows a pointer cursor.\n\nCloses #53","tree":{"sha":"c834d084646a61a9c5834bc6c293f2248b06652b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/c834d084646a61a9c5834bc6c293f2248b06652b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGIxZTZiMTU4MWI0NjFiMWEwZjk2MTk4OGRhNDI1NmRiMjViZDkxZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349","sha":"aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349"}],"sha":"b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/b1e6b1581b461b1a0f961988da4256db25bd91df"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:00:32Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:00:32Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"wip: work in progress issue #51","tree":{"sha":"10f1371f0de9cdd2b9545fce65d8bfccbcdff783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/10f1371f0de9cdd2b9545fce65d8bfccbcdff783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGFhY2JkZjM2MzdhMTEwODFhM2Q0NGQwZmNmYzY2MDc2N2JiMzQzNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36","sha":"a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36"}],"sha":"aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/aacbdf3637a11081a3d44d0fcfc660767bb34349"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:54:57Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:54:57Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): move scan button inside select, before the arrow (#52)\n\nThe scan button sat beside the Dropdown because `trailing_icon` replaces\nthe open/close arrow rather than sitting beside it. That slot is typed\n`IconDataOrControl`, though, so a Row carrying both the button and an\nexplicit arrow Icon puts the button inside the decoration box without\nlosing the affordance -- matching the table search bar''s scan-then-X pair.\n`selected_trailing_icon` gets its own pair since one control cannot occupy\ntwo tree slots. Sizes are explicit; an unconstrained IconButton there\ncarries Flutter''s ~48dp tap target and grows the field height.\n\nCloses #52","tree":{"sha":"e891d5884ce2d65ef42a731db17f3943301997ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/e891d5884ce2d65ef42a731db17f3943301997ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGEwMjcwZDRmMGIzZjFkNjhhZTY5MWM1MDVlNTZhYjJjZTBiMDBmMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17","sha":"dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17"}],"sha":"a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a0270d4f0b3f1d68ae691c505e56ab2ce0b00f36"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:39:22Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:39:22Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(frontend): scan barcode/QR into Material and Location pickers (#52)\n\nAdds components/scan_input.py::ScanInput - an icon button opening a\nsmall autofocused dialog so a keyboard-wedge scanner''s code+Enter lands\nsomewhere unambiguous. No dependency and works on web, since the\nscanner is a hardware gun rather than a camera. Wired opt-in into\nSelectForm (\"qr\": True), stock_out/item_new''s hand-built dropdown, and\nthe table search bar; codes resolve through the existing\nresolve_option_value() so there is still one matching rule app-wide.\n\nTwo knock-on fixes were required. Form.load()/serialize() located a\nselect''s value by isinstance(control, ft.Dropdown), which a\nscan-enabled select (built as a Row) would have failed silently, so\nboth now read Form.select[name].select. And\nC_stock_out/get_stock_by_material ignored the table-keyword-filter its\nown search box had always sent - that box had never filtered anything -\nso it now binds the param and filters on location code/name.\n\nCloses #52","tree":{"sha":"795832fe6459b8cdb0dd73a002c2793bcb46e0f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/795832fe6459b8cdb0dd73a002c2793bcb46e0f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGRkZGQwMTBiYzkyNDMzMmVjYjllNzE1ZGU2MDMwYmQ0MTgwNmNjMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2","sha":"88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2"}],"sha":"dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dddd010bc924332ecb9e715de6030bd41806cc17"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:14:15Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:14:15Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: track issue #52 (scan barcode/QR into stock item pickers)\n\nRecords the premise correction - senar has no camera QR scanner, only\nQR generation and a hardware keyboard-wedge pattern - plus the three\nintegration points and the existing resolve_option_value() helper to\nreuse for code matching.","tree":{"sha":"470b6c4024f833fc68be9fc7d58f60c0977885b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/470b6c4024f833fc68be9fc7d58f60c0977885b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDg4NTI1ZWZjZDkwMjA5YjQ4NjdjMTRiMTg1ZjViZDhiZjU3NzgzZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593","sha":"55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593"}],"sha":"88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/88525efcd90209b4867c14b185f5bd8bf57783f2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:01:52Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T09:01:52Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: mark #51 closed (auto-closed on push via commit trailer)","tree":{"sha":"9c8646df1ac6d876d5e4755280ee0cde94477105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/9c8646df1ac6d876d5e4755280ee0cde94477105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDU1ZDZlYTcwNmNmZDVmZjY1N2NlODg1MWNmOTg2ODI1YWU0NDQ1OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96","sha":"5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96"}],"sha":"55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/55d6ea706cfd5ff657ce8851cf986825ae444593"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:48:02Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:48:02Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): keep the current screen on reload instead of bouncing home\n\n_boot_navigate() only ever targeted /server_config, /home or /login, so\nreloading at a /modules/... route discarded it and sent you to /home.\nThat was always the case but was masked by the splash hang fixed in the\nprevious commit. Adds _preserved_boot_route(), used only in the\nactive-session branch, so a logged-out deep link still falls through to\n/login and the boot conditions keep owning /, /login and /server_config.\n\nRefs #51","tree":{"sha":"a7f938722f601af500afaa788d681e948357405a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/a7f938722f601af500afaa788d681e948357405a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDVlZmFmMTE0MzQ5NDc3MDk3MmZkYjA4NzZiMWE1ZWU2NDQ5NDRlOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082","sha":"c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082"}],"sha":"5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5efaf1143494770972fdb0876b1a5ee644944e96"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:39:33Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:39:33Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): build the boot view when already on the target route (#51)\n\npage.push_route() only delegates to the client, which fires\non_route_change back to Python when the route actually changes - so a\nreload with a deep link still in the address bar (what a container\nrestart produces) made the boot push a silent no-op, route_change()\nnever ran, and main()''s splash was never replaced.\n\nAdds _boot_navigate_to(), which awaits route_change() directly when\npage.route already equals the target - the same approach Flet''s own\npush_route docstring uses to render the initial view - and routes all\nthree boot destinations through it.\n\nCloses #51","tree":{"sha":"ed120fc1e4f4aba035324d6a19fff83c35bebf67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/ed120fc1e4f4aba035324d6a19fff83c35bebf67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGMwY2E1YThkOGY1NDg0ZTJmZDVlMGNjYmFhNWEzZWMzMTI2ZDgwODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95","sha":"c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95"}],"sha":"c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c0ca5a8d8f5484e2fd5e0ccbaa5a3ec3126d8082"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:23:52Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:23:52Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: track issue #51 (splash hang on deep-link boot)\n\n_boot_navigate() only ever calls push_route, which no-ops when the\nbrowser is already at the target URL - so on_route_change never fires\nand the splash is never replaced. Records the root cause and both\ncandidate fixes; no code change yet.","tree":{"sha":"8566a3cfea10da09c10aae2bf9e06899b6b11bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/8566a3cfea10da09c10aae2bf9e06899b6b11bf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGMxYTZhOTM1MzZhZDBjNzc1Yzk5NGNlZGE0MGFiM2M0MTFiZjJhOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5","sha":"569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5"}],"sha":"c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/c1a6a93536ad0c775c994ceda40ab3c411bf2a95"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:14:42Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:14:42Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: track issue #50 (resize handle fails on second drag)\n\nFollow-up to 53b94a3, which fixed the first drag on a screen. Records\nthe failure alongside the approaches already ruled out, so the next\nattempt doesn''t repeat them. Deferred deliberately.","tree":{"sha":"3ee69651ebb22642eb24803ed033800f282b18c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/3ee69651ebb22642eb24803ed033800f282b18c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDU2OWNlMDFiZGIwNDBmZDRiYTQ4YzQ5YTg3NzczZjhmYTRjMTQ3YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b","sha":"53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b"}],"sha":"569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/569ce01bdb040fd4ba48c49a87773f8fa4c147b5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:10:17Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:10:17Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(table): ignore resize-handle events from stale screen instances\n\nNavigating between module screens leaves the previous screen''s\nGestureDetector widgets alive on the client, still dispatching pointer\nevents into the old TableColumns instance (the handler closures keep it\nalive). Diagnostics confirmed hovering a 2-column table''s single handle\nfired handlers on both the live instance and a stale 3-column one from\nan earlier screen - so a hover would get handled by the stale instance\nand paint a bar that isn''t on screen, or only one half of an\nenter/exit pair would reach the live one.\n\nThat, not the highlight bookkeeping three earlier rounds kept\nrewriting, is why the handle showed no color on hover and sometimes\nstayed lit after the cursor left. Adds TableColumns._is_live() (checks\npage.data[\"active_tables\"], already cleared on route change) to guard\nthe handlers, collapses highlight state to a single flag read by a\nsingle function, and flushes via a targeted bar.update() after\nconfirming page.update() does not flush this nested change at all.","tree":{"sha":"f424b0f93bec5c605e945706833fee8149bd2979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/f424b0f93bec5c605e945706833fee8149bd2979"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDUzYjk0YTNmZjk0MWU5YzI3MWZjNGFiOWIzMjFjNWIxMGJkYTA0NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9","sha":"b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9"}],"sha":"53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/53b94a3ff941e9c271fc4ab9b321c5b10bda045b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:11:08Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:11:08Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: mark #48 closed, confirm live fix for window resize","tree":{"sha":"f08b763939be946a04e83a5dc9739126dfceb535","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/f08b763939be946a04e83a5dc9739126dfceb535"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGI1ZmM3NDFmYTFiY2MwZjI5OWU1NzZhNTA3MDYxNDkxN2E3ZGRhYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8","sha":"e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8"}],"sha":"b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/b5fc741fa1bcc0f299e576a5070614917a7ddaa9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:07:20Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:07:20Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): register page.on_resize, not the nonexistent on_resized\n\nmain.py wired the window/browser resize handler to page.on_resized (a\ntypo''d attribute name), but Flet''s actual BasePage field is on_resize\n(no \"d\"). Page isn''t a slotted dataclass, so the typo never raised - it\nsilently attached a dead attribute instead of registering a real\nhandler, meaning every table on every screen has been ignoring window\nresize/maximize entirely, confirmed by direct user testing after the\nprevious rescale-logic fix alone didn''t resolve it.","tree":{"sha":"408c589e0d33485c0eabab75f50a043773afe8da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/408c589e0d33485c0eabab75f50a043773afe8da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGUzZjc3MTg1ZDYxZGFkNWNiMjU0MTM5NjQwODg4OTAwODQ5ZGZhZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28","sha":"e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28"}],"sha":"e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e3f77185d61dad5cb254139640888900849dfad8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:00:34Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:00:34Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(table): rescale manually-resized columns on window resize (#48)\n\nTableColumns.load() previously treated a window-resize reload exactly\nlike any other reload once a table''s columns had ever been manually\ndrag-resized - the frozen absolute-pixel widths never changed, so the\ntable silently stopped responding to the browser window''s size from\nthat point on. Adds a rescale param, threaded from\nTable.on_page_resize(), that proportionally rescales manual widths to\nfit the new screen width instead of leaving them frozen; a normal\n(non-resize) reload keeps the exact prior behavior unchanged.\n\nVerified via a dedicated logic test against the real code path, and\nmanual drag-resize re-confirmed live in the browser. Whether\npage.on_resized itself fires on a genuine browser window resize on web\ncould not be confirmed this session - the available automation\nenvironment runs at a fixed display resolution (resize_window reports\nsuccess but window.innerWidth never changes) - documented as an open\nquestion in AGENTS.md rather than left unclear.\n\nCloses #48","tree":{"sha":"ca35464dd23c00a802f64d111f5a3f2223d9046e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/ca35464dd23c00a802f64d111f5a3f2223d9046e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGU5YWMxYWZlNDY1ZTBjNGM3YzAxMjkxNDUxOWFkNTE1MzFmNmVjMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6","sha":"8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6"}],"sha":"e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e9ac1afe465e0c4c7c012914519ad51531f6ec28"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:43:02Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:43:02Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: mark #49 closed (auto-closed on push via commit trailer)","tree":{"sha":"39f2c9c1790559f1ec8a7d59b214155b52e602bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/39f2c9c1790559f1ec8a7d59b214155b52e602bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDhmZWUzZmI4ODcxYTllYzQyYTY2YTNkMjg4OGJlMWMwYWQ3YzRiZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4","sha":"4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4"}],"sha":"8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8fee3fb8871a9ec42a66a3d2888be1c0ad7c4bd6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:41:20Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:41:20Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): add top padding to master_config/mail_config screens (#49)\n\nBoth singleton settings screens (Application Config, Mail Config) looked\ncramped against their toolbar compared to regular new/edit Form screens.\nTraced the padding chain first: Form.build()''s own padding arg is dead\ncode for vertical spacing everywhere, and ModuleView.build()''s default\nis identical across every screen shape, so there was no existing knob to\nchange without also affecting new/edit screens. Wraps just these two\nscreens'' body() in an explicit top-padded Container instead.\n\nVerified live: both screens now show a visible gap before their first\nfield; ap_module/edit (new/edit Form) and Table screens are unaffected.\n\nCloses #49","tree":{"sha":"b2164dc76796923fb75a205d8bb5ce9ff91d4c78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/b2164dc76796923fb75a205d8bb5ce9ff91d4c78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDRiNWE3NzcyNDY2NTAxZDM2NWU4NTQ2OWVhNmRhZDU3ODQ2MWU5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b","sha":"128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b"}],"sha":"4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4b5a7772466501d365e85469ea6dad578461e9f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:03:14Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:03:14Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: track issues #48/#49 (table window-resize, Form top padding)\n\nFiled after a /planner investigation: window-resize responsiveness is\npermanently disabled once a table''s column has ever been manually\nresized, and page.on_resized has never been confirmed to fire on a real\nbrowser resize in the web target (#48). The master_config/mail_config\n\"cramped\" look isn''t backed by an actual padding difference anywhere in\nthe code - Form''s own padding argument is dead for vertical spacing on\nevery screen; the fix is an isolated per-file wrap on just those two\nscreens (#49).","tree":{"sha":"9f6c6d05990c2ee0057d9ae0194539ff62e9b0ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/9f6c6d05990c2ee0057d9ae0194539ff62e9b0ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDEyODQzMWRlOGU3OWRhYzM0ODM1NTQ3ZmZhMjBhZDdjMDE1YzkwM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de","sha":"85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de"}],"sha":"128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/128431de8e79dac34835547ffa20ad7c015c903b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:42:46Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:42:46Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: mark #47 closed (auto-closed on push via commit trailer)","tree":{"sha":"2eb92e29fcee666561b17470b73ce223bc1fd3f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/2eb92e29fcee666561b17470b73ce223bc1fd3f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDg1ZDY0Y2UxYWJmMDcwODkzZWY2MjY0MDdiMTIzNjgzODQyYjgwZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06","sha":"6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06"}],"sha":"85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/85d64ce1abf070893ef626407b123683842b80de"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:39:04Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T05:39:04Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(backend): app-wide configurable timezone via zoneinfo, UTC storage (#47)\n\nEvery created_at/updated_at column used to come from the DB container''s\nown clock (server_default=func.now()), so behavior silently depended on\nwhatever timezone the host happened to run in. Adds core/timezone.py\n(AwareDateTime TypeDecorator - MariaDB has no native TIMESTAMPTZ, so this\nconverts to/from UTC at the Python/DB boundary itself; get_app_timezone()\nreads the live, admin-editable app_configs.timezone row on every call, no\nrestart needed) and switches all 20 models to Python-side utcnow()\ndefaults instead of func.now(). APP_TIMEZONE env var only seeds the DB\nrow''s boot-time default (Asia/Jakarta); master_config''s new Timezone\nselect field is the live setting from then on.\n\nVerified end-to-end via direct HTTP calls against the real running\nstack: config round-trip (incl. invalid-timezone rejection), a stock\nmovement item''s displayed created_at correctly re-converts when the\nconfigured timezone changes with no DB write-back, and a freshly created\nrow''s stored created_at matches true UTC regardless of DB clock. Not\nconfirmed in a live browser - hit a pre-existing Flet \"push_route can\nhang\" flakiness class unrelated to this change.\n\nCloses #47","tree":{"sha":"ed475ee55aa31413c7cb2d24f1d852db3ae74efb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/ed475ee55aa31413c7cb2d24f1d852db3ae74efb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDZmY2UxMzhiYWMxNTQ5MmQ3YzBhMmQxMDEwOThkOTllZDg4MTBjMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929","sha":"460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929"}],"sha":"6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6fce138bac15492d7c0a2d101098d99ed8810c06"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T04:41:25Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T04:41:25Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: track issue #47 (app-wide configurable timezone)\n\nFiled after a /planner audit confirmed no timezone infrastructure exists\ntoday - every timestamp is DB-clock-dependent via server_default=func.now(),\nwith no zoneinfo/pytz usage and no TZ env var anywhere in the stack.","tree":{"sha":"9a93aca5c92bd9d34c32e52451ddb348069631b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/9a93aca5c92bd9d34c32e52451ddb348069631b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDQ2MGU5NmI5Yjg5NzVkZWQ1MjI2ZDcyOTQ2MzNjZjNjMjMwZmM5Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0","sha":"ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0"}],"sha":"460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/460e96b9b8975ded5226d7294633cf3c230fc929"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T04:00:17Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T04:00:17Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: sync tracked issue status (#37/#45 closed) and document icon picker in README\n\nAGENTS.md''s Tracked Issues table had #37/#45 stale as ready-for-review\nwhen both are actually closed on GitHub. Also adds a README section for\nthe new Modules-screen icon-picker dialog, which had no end-user docs.","tree":{"sha":"18198c437a851bcd54638df49baece8920619f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/18198c437a851bcd54638df49baece8920619f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGRkZjk5YThkMGE0MTJmNzQ3MmI0YjA0OTViMWYzNDU2OTNhMzIzZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b","sha":"2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b"}],"sha":"ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/ddf99a8d0a412f7472b4b0495b1f345693a323f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T03:11:25Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T03:11:25Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(table): render radio cells as a real circle-with-dot radio glyph\n\n\"radio\"-type cells were reusing the \"checkbox\" icon pair, which looked\nlike a checkbox despite behaving like a radio button. _CheckboxCellValue\nnow takes an icon_pair param (checkbox default unchanged) so radio cells\nrender ft.Icons.RADIO_BUTTON_CHECKED/UNCHECKED instead.","tree":{"sha":"b88f1a2ab5fd1e61b434b26e4efc84b5383b4f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/b88f1a2ab5fd1e61b434b26e4efc84b5383b4f7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDJjYmNmODBkZDQwYWRlYzFiMjBhM2E0ZjMzODYwNzZhODM0YmQ4NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e","sha":"e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e"}],"sha":"2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/2cbcf80dd40adec1b20a3a4f3386076a834bd86b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T03:02:27Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T03:02:27Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(form): reusable icon-picker field + selector modal (sample #45 consumer)\n\nAdds an \"icon_picker\" Form field type (read-only, tap-to-open, mirrors\nDateForm''s shape) and a reusable IconSelectorModal - an AlertDialog\nwrapping a Table whose selection column uses issue #45''s \"radio\"\nby-column mode as a real, live consumer. Wired into ap_module''s \"icon\"\nfield (previously a plain typed input).\n\nFound and fixed two real client-side rendering bugs along the way:\nft.Icon(icon=<raw string>) silently fails to paint in Flutter unless\nrouted through the existing utils/icon.py::get_icon() converter, and\nTable sizes its columns off the page''s own width rather than its\ncontainer''s, breaking badly inside a small dialog - fixed by reusing\nthe column-resize feature''s manually_resized escape hatch to give the\ndialog''s table small, fixed widths instead.\n\nVerified live end-to-end in the browser against ap_module/edit.","tree":{"sha":"d5d1c790e967c98e8bb3e6ef355b716de65b08eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/d5d1c790e967c98e8bb3e6ef355b716de65b08eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGUyMTk1YWU0Y2IxODRiMDI4ZTQ2YjQ4ZjVhOWU4N2MyMzMxN2ExMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403","sha":"a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403"}],"sha":"e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/e2195ae4cb184b028e46b48f5a9e87c23317a12e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T01:45:40Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T01:45:40Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(table): reusable radio column type for single-pick/Likert grids (#45)\n\nAdds a \"radio\" column type to the shared Table component, reusing the\ncheckbox icon control but enforcing exclusivity on click instead of\nindependent toggling. Supports two modes: by-column (default, exclusive\nacross all loaded rows) and by-row (radio_mode=\"row\" + radio_group,\nexclusive within one row only - a Likert/checklist grid). Since Flet''s\nDataTable has no native column-span, a by-row group''s shared header\nlabel is drawn as a positioned overlay Container on top of the header,\nsame technique already used for the resize-handle overlay.\n\nRe-verified inside the running frontend container (real flet 0.85.3)\nthat blank by-row headers, the spanning overlay, by-column fallthrough,\nand fixed 60px width all behave as documented before committing.\n\nCloses #45","tree":{"sha":"45bb2b165cb45d5457372a4b2d230298613335d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/45bb2b165cb45d5457372a4b2d230298613335d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGE0OTAyMWViZGNhZTYzNDg5ODVhZjI0MDdiNmFkMDQ1YzQwZDc0MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/9cfed699100d8c9189c30fae26a146dc3d18ac01","sha":"9cfed699100d8c9189c30fae26a146dc3d18ac01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/9cfed699100d8c9189c30fae26a146dc3d18ac01"}],"sha":"a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a49021ebdcae6348985af2407b6ad045c40d7403"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.