er icons for checkbox columns (#46)\n\nThe generic \"checkbox\"-type column (e.g. permission_new''s \"Select\"\ncolumn) still rendered its header as a plain text label - #44 only\nrestyled the row-level cells into icon buttons, never the header.\nAdded TableColumns._build_checkbox_header() (two icon buttons reusing\n#44''s checked/unchecked pair) and TableRows.set_all_checkbox() to\nbulk-toggle every loaded row in place, wired through Table. Also\ndocuments the new header buttons in README''s users/permissions section.\n\nCloses #46\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b86b16abe5bce0ded0d15506f5dc50d7d174a5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/2b86b16abe5bce0ded0d15506f5dc50d7d174a5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/4f42c20f8ac8ffa23cdd48fda1c1101eba11d121","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/4f42c20f8ac8ffa23cdd48fda1c1101eba11d121","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDRmNDJjMjBmOGFjOGZmYTIzY2RkNDhmZGExYzExMDFlYmExMWQxMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/487ce6bde895b8daecd9a9379cdcac18665919eb","sha":"487ce6bde895b8daecd9a9379cdcac18665919eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/487ce6bde895b8daecd9a9379cdcac18665919eb"}],"sha":"4f42c20f8ac8ffa23cdd48fda1c1101eba11d121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/4f42c20f8ac8ffa23cdd48fda1c1101eba11d121"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/487ce6bde895b8daecd9a9379cdcac18665919eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:08:20Z","email":"y