ack_inventory_system/commit/3fa70cd112b00ead89f164e629df47005a19c168","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDNmYTcwY2QxMTJiMDBlYWQ4OWYxNjRlNjI5ZGY0NzAwNWExOWMxNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/8ac566fdaf67dd7ee142b113f0d2b431c6ad8105","sha":"8ac566fdaf67dd7ee142b113f0d2b431c6ad8105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8ac566fdaf67dd7ee142b113f0d2b431c6ad8105"}],"sha":"3fa70cd112b00ead89f164e629df47005a19c168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/3fa70cd112b00ead89f164e629df47005a19c168"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/8ac566fdaf67dd7ee142b113f0d2b431c6ad8105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:56:03Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:56:03Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(table): reusable single/bulk row-remove button, fixed-width column (#42, #43)\n\nAdds an opt-in remove-row column to the shared Table component and wires\nit into revoking module grants from ap_master_user''s permission table.\nThe original Shift+click header gesture (mirroring senar) was replaced\nwith two explicit buttons per mode (Select All/Select None, Remove\nSelected/Cancel) after diagnostic logging confirmed the browser never\ndelivers keyboard events to the server in this deployment - all five\nscenarios are live-verified. Also gives the remove column a fixed width\ninstead of running it through dynamic content-based sizing (#43), since\nits required width is a known constant. README updated with the revoke\nUI walkthrough.\n\nCloses #42","tree":{"sha":"36ad7e2e258ba189b15f9f22d2a46f3d4ea76a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/36ad7e2e258b