commits/6dfd42fdaefc0e4bf06d63333ffac84a5875e36b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:58:08Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:58:08Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"chore(stock_browse): unify material/location drill-down links on link_key_field\n\nNow that link_key_field/link_screen exists for the location drill-down,\nuse it for the material drill-down too instead of the older \"key\": True\n+ Table(edit_screen=...) mechanism, which was always a slightly\nmisleading name for a target that isn''t an edit screen. Both drill-down\nlinks on stock_browse/index now go through the same per-field override.","tree":{"sha":"48b2dbfa66f43e824db4a4d219e017f3b906bfa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/48b2dbfa66f43e824db4a4d219e017f3b906bfa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/6dfd42fdaefc0e4bf06d63333ffac84a5875e36b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/6dfd42fdaefc0e4bf06d63333ffac84a5875e36b","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDZkZmQ0MmZkYWVmYzBlNGJmMDZkNjMzMzNmZmFjODRhNTg3NWUzNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/1206a6c27cc9d8715d5f3148aa5f78bdb5c6e29d","sha":"1206a6c27cc9d8715d5f3148aa5f78bdb5c6e29d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/1206a6c27cc9d8715d5f3148aa5f78bdb5c6e29d"}],"sha":"6dfd42fdaefc0e4bf06d63333ffac84a5875e36b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/6dfd42fdaefc0e4bf06d63333ffac84a5875e36b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/1206a6c27cc9d8715d5f3148aa5f78bdb5c6e29d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:50:14Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:50:14Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"feat(stock_browse): drill into stock-by-location with per-material breakdown\n\nClicking a location on stock_browse/index needed to navigate somewhere\ndifferent from clicking a material in the same row, which the existing\nsingle-key-per-table click mechanism couldn''t do. Added a field-level\nlink_key_field/link_screen override in TableRows so one cell can target\na different route than the rest of its row, then mirrored issue #29''s\nstock-by-material drill-down scoped by location instead: new backend\nlist_stock_by_location/get_location endpoints and a stock_by_location\npage showing Material Code | Material Name | Qty | Unit | Avg Price |\nValue with a totals footer.\n\nCloses #40","tree":{"sha":"174b3c9872c7046e78adf088d22fdd33f5af4e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/174b3c9872c7046e78adf088d22fdd33f5af4e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/1206a6c27cc9d8715d5f3148aa5f78bdb5c6e29d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/1206a6c27cc9d8715d5f3148aa5f78bdb5c6e29d","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDEyMDZhNmMyN2NjOWQ4NzE1ZDVmMzE0OGFhNWY3OGJkYjVjNmUyOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/19728253dc05be967fedeffd62200462845becd5","sha":"19728253dc05be967fedeffd62200462845becd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/19728253dc05be967fedeff