c1c566311693819b71ba5ea02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:30:35Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:30:35Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): stop lazy-load append from flashing a jump to the top\n\nTable.load()''s append path always rebuilt the whole scrollable Column/\nDataTable, which starts the client at scroll offset 0 - the previous\nrestore_scroll_position() call corrected this after the fact, causing\na visible jump-then-snap-back. Patching the already-mounted DataTable\nin place for an append (TableBody.update()) keeps the same scrollable\nwrapper mounted, so its scroll position is never lost to begin with.\n\nCloses #39","tree":{"sha":"d4a2b0598d9790c2143e4b6531388b89af2630e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/d4a2b0598d9790c2143e4b6531388b89af2630e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/66351de06b13fbcc1c566311693819b71ba5ea02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/66351de06b13fbcc1c566311693819b71ba5ea02","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDY2MzUxZGUwNmIxM2ZiY2MxYzU2NjMxMTY5MzgxOWI3MWJhNWVhMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd","sha":"dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd"}],"sha":"66351de06b13fbcc1c566311693819b71ba5ea02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/66351de06b13fbcc1c566311693819b71ba5ea02"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:20:44Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:20:44Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: mark #38 closed","tree":{"sha":"6eba37adecd3142fc87bf0a55e69c42552290cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/6eba37adecd3142fc87bf0a55e69c42552290cf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGRkNGYzYmFjNDMzMmRlOWM1N2FmZDJjYmVkNzZkMjk3OTVjYzQxZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a","sha":"a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a"}],"sha":"dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/dd4f3bac4332de9c57afd2cbed76d29795cc41fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:10:47Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:10:47Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): keep sort icon pinned to its own column, not bleeding into the next\n\nSortable column headers laid the label and sort icon out as plain Row\nsiblings, which gives non-flex children unbounded width - so a label''s\nELLIPSIS overflow never actually kicked in and the whole header cell\ncould render wider than its column, spilling into the next one.\nWrapping the label side in an expand=True Container gives it a real\nbounded width (Flutter''s Expanded-equivalent for the leftover Row\nspace), fixing the ellipsis and keeping the icon pinned to the column''s\nown right edge.\n\nCloses #38","tree":{"sha":"17fbfb126def26c12c2d6574edbf5aa7ec3723d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/17fbfb126def26c12c2d6574edbf5aa7ec3723d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGE2YTU3OTUxMDZhZDQ1MDJhZmNhNTc2ZGI4NWQ4NzVjZDhmZDliM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131","sha":"5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131"}],"sha":"a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a6a5795106ad4502afca576db85d875cd8fd9b3a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T07:57:34Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T07:57:34Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"docs: update README''s Server Configuration section for web (#36)\n\nIssue #36 removed the Server Configuration screen entirely from the web\ndeployment (the address is fixed and no longer user-editable there), so\nthe README''s \"forces you to the Server Configuration screen\" description\nwas stale for the exact deployment this README walks through. Replaced\nwith an accurate \"no setup step before login\" description, noting the\nnative desktop/mobile build still has that screen.","tree":{"sha":"b78b762bd74d38f8287929107a75d77db18235d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/b78b762bd74d38f8287929107a75d77db18235d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKDVkOWY5MTYyYWU0ZDYwMjgwZjg4YTVlYTk0ZTdiNDZiMzQzN2UxMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6","sha":"a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6"}],"sha":"5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/5d9f9162ae4d60280f88a5ea94e7b46b3437e131"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T07:55:55Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T07:55:55Z","email":"yohan.naftali@ptsenopati.com","name":"yohannaftali"},"message":"fix(frontend): lazy-load never fetches next page + resets scroll on append (#39)\n\nTableBody._on_scroll() detected the scroll-near-bottom condition but never\ncalled self.on_scroll_end(), so infinite-scroll silently did nothing on\nevery table. Also fixed two adjacent bugs found during live verification:\nTable.get_data() always overwrote self.data with just the latest page\neven when append=True, under-reporting the footer''s row count; and a\npage whose content doesn''t overflow the viewport (Flet''s on_scroll never\nfires without a scroll gesture) had no way to load its remaining pages,\nfixed via Table._should_eagerly_load_more(), a page-height heuristic that\nruns independent of any scroll event. Finally, restored the user''s scroll\nposition after a lazy-load append instead of jumping back to the top,\nsince Table.load() rebuilds the scrollable DataTable from scratch on\nevery append. Verified live in both a tall (no-scroll) and normal\nviewport.\n\nCloses #39","tree":{"sha":"48bf8b123880682c4dd27c4a7679856aac00f394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/trees/48bf8b123880682c4dd27c4a7679856aac00f394"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/git/commits/a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6","node_id":"C_kwDOTRapbNoAKGE4ZjJhZjM3ZGZlOGNjYWU2YTQ0YzUwYzYzNWRiOTYzZWY0OGEwZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commit/d6ec3bd7bec5df1fd7cf6e08875ddc82edb1c4c1","sha":"d6ec3bd7bec5df1fd7cf6e08875ddc82edb1c4c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/d6ec3bd7bec5df1fd7cf6e08875ddc82edb1c4c1"}],"sha":"a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits/a8f2af37dfe8ccae6a44c50c635db963ef48a0d6"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/yohannaftali/simple_full_stack_inventory_system/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=603561f3f478e430b0728a1f47cfbbca85e3f701&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A25%3A45.580Z"}');
