_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/75e42c845e6f59b2274a06eb3f027c74f95ee36e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:57:01Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:57:01Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"feat(introspection): mark when Vite''s dev work for a request is done\n\nA development episode recorded matched and then nothing until the loader\nstarted. On a boot''s first request to an app that gap is hundreds of\nmilliseconds of Vite loading the render module, collecting styles and\ntransforming the template, and a reader could not tell it from slow\napplication code.\n\nThe episode timeline gains devAssetsReady, recorded once per request\nafter that work and before the loader runs, on both render strategies.\nIt is absent when no Vite dev server handled the request. EpisodeRecorder\ngains the matching method; the MCP episode type and schema name the mark.\n\nMeasured on the Solid playground: first request matched 1.6, devAssetsReady\n266.6, dataStart 267.1; the next request devAssetsReady 2.4.","tree":{"sha":"45daf1d6631f094c039e4fe9c2d0ac08ad7cde17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/45daf1d6631f094c039e4fe9c2d0ac08ad7cde17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/75e42c845e6f59b2274a06eb3f027c74f95ee36e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/fo