owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/a4afd00ae645673750ff0932aeede3d7657e6ae1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:23:23Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:23:23Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"fix(introspection): validate boot markers before sweeping and check folder identity at discovery\n\nReview of the per-boot substrate found three holes. The sweep deleted\non any parseable object carrying a closed state or a dead pid; it now\nrequires a valid lifecycle marker whose state is active or closed, whose\nbootId equals the folder name, whose pid is a positive integer and whose\nstartedAt is present, and treats anything else as unknown. Inside a boot\nfolder a marker without a state read as live; it is now dev_json_invalid,\nwhile the root compatibility path keeps state optional. The identity\ncheck ran only when a graph was read and only with a valid marker; the\nmarker-versus-folder check now runs at discovery, a disagreeing folder is\nnever live and never a stale candidate, every tool refuses\nsubstrate_inconsistent when nothing valid remains, taujs_overview reports\nignoredFolders otherwise, and any graph in a boot folder must be a boot\ngraph naming that folder regardless of the marker.","tree":{"sha":"cdc8f5dbafb7c6633738501c348c6d942c79da5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/cdc8f5dbafb7c6633738501c348c6d942c79da5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/a4afd00ae645673750ff0932aeede3d7657e6ae1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/a4afd00ae645673750ff0932aeede3d7657e6ae1","node_id":"C_kwDOTRcsBtoAKGE0YWZkMDBhZTY0NTY3Mzc1MGZmMDkzMmFlZWRlM2Q3NjU3ZTZhZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd","sha":"088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd"}],"sha":"a4afd00ae645673750ff0932aeede3d7657e6ae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/a4afd00ae645673750ff0932aeede3d7657e6ae1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:47:22Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:47:22Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"feat(mcp): discover per-boot substrate folders\n\nThe reader lists node_modules/.taujs/boots/ and classifies each folder by\nits own dev.json, keeping every state it had and adding closed, which is\nchecked before the pid because two servers can share a process. One live\nfolder answers as before. Several live folders refuse every tool with\nmultiple_active_boots naming each boot; there is no selector, since boot\nids change on every restart. With no live folder the newest graph by\nemittedAt wins between the newest boot folder and dist/.taujs/graph.json,\nand the staleness line names the boot. A folder whose folder name,\ndev.json bootId and graph bootId disagree refuses as\nsubstrate_inconsistent; a schema v3 boot graph without a bootId is\nmalformed. An older root-only substrate still reads through the\nunchanged root path.","tree":{"sha":"d038b8a0601e9bee6e2d9ea1bfe991e293854b8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/d038b8a0601e9bee6e2d9ea1bfe991e293854b8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd","node_id":"C_kwDOTRcsBtoAKDA4ODk2MGZlMzE2YWZkZTJmODcwNzIxNTdiZDRlYjYwMmIzMTViY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a2c1da03ddcc3a7ab74","sha":"0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a2c1da03ddcc3a7ab74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a2c1da03ddcc3a7ab74"}],"sha":"088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/088960fe316afde2f87072157bd4eb602b315bcd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a2c1da03ddcc3a7ab74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:10:10Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:10:10Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"feat(introspection): per-boot substrate directories\n\nEach development boot writes its introspection substrate under\nnode_modules/.taujs/boots/<bootId>/ and never touches another boot''s\nfolder. Two boots in one project previously shared one substrate: the\nlater boot''s close removed the shared marker and a reader could join a\ngraph from one boot with episodes from another.\n\ndev.json is the first write in the folder, with state active, and is\nrewritten last on graceful close with state closed; it is never removed.\nOn start a boot sweeps sibling folders that are closed or whose pid is\ndead, keeping the newest so stale structural reads survive, and never\ntouches a folder it cannot read or whose pid is alive. Boot graphs carry\na required bootId equal to the folder name under schema version 3; build\ngraphs still land at dist/.taujs/graph.json with no bootId. The live\n/__taujs/graph overlay carries the same bootId. Temp names carry the\nbootId beside the pid.\n\nThe reader side (@taujs/mcp) only takes the type and version bump here;\nboots/ discovery and the new refusals follow in the next commit.","tree":{"sha":"47079ada2d58b3a814f4485dced3872f48012b94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/47079ada2d58b3a814f4485dced3872f48012b94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a2c1da03ddcc3a7ab74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a2c1da03ddcc3a7ab74","node_id":"C_kwDOTRcsBtoAKDBjOGNjNzBkY2JlM2M3NTc1ZWFhM2EyYzFkYTAzZGRjYzNhN2FiNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/8409b462ba98059dedef746b9a870cd04d0569bd","sha":"8409b462ba98059dedef746b9a870cd04d0569bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/8409b462ba98059dedef746b9a870cd04d0569bd"}],"sha":"0c8cc70dcbe3c7575eaa3a