rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/a0e76d88c2dd0bf84f23dc52e34849ae208d993c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:36:54Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:37:30Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"fix(mcp): omit concurrency on a collapsed window and count route data kinds by explicit case\n\nReview of the agent legibility residue branch found two agent-facing edges\nin the new reader code. A service call whose ms rounded to 0 has an empty\nhalf-open window and reported peak 0 across 1 call, contradicting the rule\nthat sequential calls give 1; taujs_get_episode now omits serviceConcurrency\nwhen any window collapses, as it does for a missing startMs. The route data\ncount used an in check that admits prototype names such as constructor and\nsummed only known kinds for the sentence''s denominator; it now switches on\nthe three known kinds and cites the route count.","tree":{"sha":"ed7a1088dd4750d8f5fdc7001bddc52bb47b734b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/ed7a1088dd4750d8f5fdc7001bddc52bb47b734b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/a0e76d88c2dd0bf84f23dc52e34849ae208d993c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/a0e76d88c2dd0bf84f23dc52e34849ae208d993c","node_id":"C_kwDOTRcsBtoAKGEwZTc2ZDg4YzJkZDBiZjg0ZjIzZGM1MmUzNDg0OWFlMjA4ZDk5M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3/taujs/commit/65ccb1e2845cf3fba93b06a977dedc8129fdfbe6","sha":"65ccb1e2845cf3fba93b06a977dedc8129fdfbe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/65ccb1e2845cf3fba93b06a977dedc8129fdfbe6"}],"sha":"a0e76d88c2dd0bf84f23dc52e34849ae208d993c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/a0e76d88c2dd0bf84f23dc52e34849ae208d993c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/65ccb1e2845cf3fba93b06a977dedc8129fdfbe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:46:50Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:46:50Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"feat(introspection): record service-call start offsets and derive peak concurrency\n\nItem 2 of the OMP Hydrogen session residue. An episode''s serviceCalls carried\nduration and outcome but no start, so a reader could not tell five overlapping\ncalls from five sequential ones. Each entry now carries startMs, relative to\nthe episode''s t0.\n\ncallServiceMethod resolves attribution before starting its timer. Previously\nthe first host-attributed call began timing before its lazy host episode\nexisted, which the new HostAttribution cell proves as a negative offset under\nthe old ordering. ms now measures method execution, not attribution overhead.\nAbort and unknown service or method checks stay ahead of attribution, so an\ninvalid call still opens no host episode.\n\ntaujs_get_episode derives serviceConcurrency (totalCalls, peakConcurrent) by a\nsweep over half-open windows, ends before starts at equal timestamps, only\nwhen every call carries startMs. Older episodes get no field rather than a\nguess. The deferredData comment no longer claims serviceCalls is bounded.","tree":{"sha":"be1e98ad701373d5b893ee26729adf876818e054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/be1e98ad701373d5b893ee26729adf876818e054"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/65ccb1e2845cf3fba93b06a977dedc8129fdfbe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"a