ttps://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/commits/940d922fed6f6ece0a8ae981a76f84e96573440d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:29:51Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:29:51Z","email":"aoedeltd@gmail.com","name":"aoede"},"message":"feat(mcp): refuse unknown tool argument keys and explain closure-loader route data\n\nItem 1 and item 3 of the OMP Hydrogen session residue. defineTool now applies\nstrict() centrally so an unrecognised argument key is refused by the SDK\nvalidation path with a message naming the key, instead of being stripped and a\ndefault applied in silence. Persisted substrate schemas stay loose by design.\n\ntaujs_overview derives routeData counts per data kind and, when any route\nresolves attr.data in a closure, a note scoped to attr.data: no declared\nbody-data edge, head and deferred declarations unaffected, calls appear as\nobserved edges once the route has run. taujs_explain_route carries the same\nnote per dynamic route.","tree":{"sha":"3a668fc4935df01496a962cb83e2a1056da818ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/trees/3a668fc4935df01496a962cb83e2a1056da818ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aoede3/taujs/git/commits/940d922fed6f6ece0a8ae981a76f84e96573440d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5754832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aoede3","id":5754832,"login":"aoede3","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTQ4MzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoede3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aoed