":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:12:44Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:12:44Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"chore: conventional Dependabot titles, rebuild bundle for webpack 5.111.1\n\nDependabot takes the PR title from the commit message, and the shared\n\"Lint PR Title\" check requires a conventional-commit type, so every\n\"Bump X from A to B\" PR failed it. A chore prefix with scope yields\n\"chore(deps): bump ...\".\n\nAlso regenerates the committed webpack output after #28/#29 merged, so the\nartifacts match the declared dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"5deeaa1774ef1ff125073b4473bec324a60ee28a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/trees/5deeaa1774ef1ff125073b4473bec324a60ee28a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/commits/f04043a8ebd5c26ff33dd6a2f2b722eaa044c683","verification":{"payload":"tree 5deeaa1774ef1ff125073b4473bec324a60ee28a\nparent af61ca61527c1a12b14bfe55b89eb825017f3024\nauthor Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1790935964 +0200\ncommitter Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1790935964 +0200\n\nchore: conventional Dependabot titles, rebuild bundle for webpack 5.111.1\n\nDependabot takes the PR title from the commit message, and the shared\n\"Lint PR Title\" check requires a conventional-commit type, so every\n\"Bump X from A to B\" PR failed it. A chore prefix with scope yields\n\"chore(deps): bump ...\".\n\nAlso regenerates the committed webpack output after #28/#29 merged, so the\nartifacts match the declared dependencies.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxzRFB70MBDXtpH9zHkA99FQ4YK\nsd17enK5qeADD0Q4UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJu76L05iLeam1PzXmi/Cgz95NtAKn+2CzYVIRJq/RxIcDLH9WZD83OSdBi/qAOZJ3\nvN8O2qSAQ9WffYaNIjIQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T10: