i.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/commits/509ea9ea1ea331d7fae555907e9989153a84bc87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:01:10Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:01:10Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"feat: accessibility scorecards show the automated pass rate\n\nA big green 0 read as a failing grade, and Accessibility was the only tab\nwhere zero meant good (Ecodesign already shows passed/total). Each WCAG level\nnow shows the share of applicable automated rules that passed.\n\nWorded \"automated rules passed\", never \"compliant\": axe covers a subset of\nWCAG, so 100% is not a conformity claim. Undecided rules stay out of the\nratio, the ratio is floored so one failing rule never shows as 100%, a level\nwith nothing to test shows no score, and failing levels still give the\nviolation and element counts. FR copy drops \"conformes\" too.\n\nDisplay only: computed in the tab from the existing result, so no cache\nschema bump. Tab badges stay issue counts.","tree":{"sha":"20b84f415657c9b60693f12d16584901e7d6a125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/trees/20b84f415657c9b60693f12d16584901e7d6a125"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/commits/509ea9ea1ea331d7fae555907e9989153a84bc87","verification":{"payload":"tree 20b84f415657c9b60693f12d16584901e7d6a125\nparent b3698583351add8f9c0264c62216a7e0e78d5f78\nauthor Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1790935270 +0200\ncommitter Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1790935270 +0200\n\nfeat: accessibility scorecards show the automated pass rate\n\nA big green 0 read as a failing grade, and Accessibility was the only tab\nwhere zero meant good (Ecodesign already shows passed/total). Each WCAG level\nnow shows the share of applicable automated rules that passed.\n\nWorded \"automated rules passed\", never \"compliant\": axe covers a subset of\nWCAG, so 100% is not a conformity claim. Undecided rules stay out of the\nratio, the ratio is floored so one failing rule never shows as 100%, a level\nwith nothing to test shows no score, and failing levels still give the\nviolation and element counts. FR copy drops \"conformes\" too.\n\nDisplay only: computed in the tab from the existing result, so no cache\nschema bump. Tab badges stay issue counts.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxzRFB70MBDXtpH9zHkA99FQ4YK\nsd17enK5qeADD0Q4UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQImoX6/HPV5/j1RXLhOVa6UQX+J+hgnZWhtgsx7hsuElJ8ZYobF6GfP43rBAJaTqXZ\nIToiNX/ekkzFN6O+JhIQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T10:01:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/509ea9ea1ea331d7fae555907e9989153a84bc87","node_id":"C_kwDOTR_UPtoAKDUwOWVhOWVhMWVhMzMxZDdmYWU1NTU5MDdlOTk4OTE1M2E4NGJjODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github