om","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:45:25Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"ci: skip the Nexus staging repository when releasing\n\nnexus-staging-maven-plugin 1.5.1 reflects into the JDK and cannot run on\nJava 17; opening java.util only moved the failure to java.lang.reflect, so\nthe plugin is not usable in this container at all.\n\nskip_staging deploys artifacts straight to the release repository instead of\nstaging-then-promote, so the release-publication step finds nothing to promote.\nAccepted deliberately to unblock releases; the durable fix is a staging plugin\nthat supports Java 17 in the parent POM, after which this input goes away.","tree":{"sha":"49e2f754bdf699cd6df32d1fc659ec98d6f20089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/trees/49e2f754bdf699cd6df32d1fc659ec98d6f20089"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/commits/87fe2d012403c2497c00b3c0258f71ef60dd6054","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/87fe2d012403c2497c00b3c0258f71ef60dd6054","node_id":"C_kwDOTR_UPtoAKDg3ZmUyZDAxMjQwM2MyNDk3YzAwYjNjMDI1OGY3MWVmNjBkZDYwNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/21b74ceaf90082713db05394cf160f48d468a36e","sha":"21b74ceaf90082713db05394cf160f48d468a36e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/commits/21b74ceaf90082713db05394cf160f48d468a36e"}],"sha":"87fe2d012403c2497c00b3c0258f71ef60dd6054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/commits/87fe2d012403c2497c00b3c0258f71ef60dd6054"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/commits/21b74ceaf90082713db05394cf160f48d468a36e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:37:37Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:37:37Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Docs: record the three blockers in the shared Jahia release workflow\n\nFour release attempts for 1.6.0, each failing further along: git safe.directory\nin the container, jahia-ci lacking push access, and nexus-staging-maven-plugin\n1.5.1 reflecting into a Java 17 JDK. Also records that release:prepare pushes\nbefore perform runs, so a failed release leaves main on the next development\nversion with an unpublished tag, and how to recover.","tree":{"sha":"e47c22fdb5bfa772412662f52d7d1f78109b21fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/trees/e47c22fdb5bfa772412662f52d7d1f78109b21fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/commits/21b74ceaf90082713db05394cf160f48d468a36e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/21b74ceaf90082713db05394cf160f48d468a36e","node_id":"C_kwDOTR_UPtoAKDIxYjc0Y2VhZjkwMDgyNzEzZGIwNTM5NGNmMTYwZjQ4ZDQ2OGEzNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/c4d9e60d8d755fade760e3c44fb4dd49a8143c7b","sha":"c4d9e60d8d755fade760e3c44fb4dd49a8143c7b","u