6Z","email":"julian.maurel@jahia.com","name":"Julian Maurel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:34:46Z","email":"julian.maurel@jahia.com","name":"Julian Maurel"},"message":"Security: harden AI review endpoint (authz, rate limit, CSRF, no unauth disclosure/error leak)\n\nFixes #16.\n- doPost: bind review to a page the caller can read + per-user rate limit (30/10min)\n  -> closes unlimited LLM calls by any authenticated user/PAT billed to the org key\n- doGet: require non-guest -> no unauthenticated provider/model disclosure\n- doPost: require application/json + same-origin (Origin/Referer) -> CSRF\n- error branch: generic message, no provider/exception detail to the client\n- links.js: only verify same-origin links on a read-only content-serving allowlist\n  (/cms/render, /cms/file, /files) with the editor session","tree":{"sha":"f0f60f0d654c638b945b5ddd3cea8be1bfec0b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/trees/f0f60f0d654c638b945b5ddd3cea8be1bfec0b76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/git/commits/6dfd43037b43948a66c77e1b7a6061f19ca99954","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/6dfd43037b43948a66c77e1b7a6061f19ca99954","node_id":"C_kwDOTR_UPtoAKDZkZmQ0MzAzN2I0Mzk0OGE2NmM3N2UxYjdhNjA2MWYxOWNhOTk5NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/page-audit/commit/b7b523ef99e2c98ef48387182a7c1bc616b1cac8","sha":"b7b523ef99e2c98ef48387182a7c1bc616b1cac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/commits/b7b523ef99e2c98ef48387182a7c1bc616b1cac8"}],"sha":"6dfd43037b43948a66c77e1b7a6061f19ca99954","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/page-audit/commits/6dfd43037b43948a66c77e1b7a6061f19ca99954"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http