masci-ca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gmasci-ca","id":39516751,"login":"gmasci-ca","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTE2NzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmasci-ca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codearchitects/CodeArchitects.EnterprisePlatform.WebStack/commits/411b991980d013ff9d2eebd156a51647804dd72a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T16:45:40Z","email":"39516751+gmasci-ca@users.noreply.github.com","name":"gmasci-ca"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T16:45:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/storybook (#7)\n\n* feat(storybook): add monorepo Storybook and broaden accessibility verification\n\nAdds a single monorepo Storybook instance (npm run storybook / build-storybook)\ndocumenting every component in @ca-webstack/ng-components and\n@ca-webstack/ng-components-extra, compiled from source and hosted from a new\nroot angular.json application project. Every component gets co-located\nstories covering its main use cases, controls, and autodocs.\n\nThe same stories back an automated accessibility test suite that runs in CI\non every change:\n- Structural checks via axe-core at WCAG 2.2 AA across every story\n  (npm run test:a11y).\n- Keyboard-interaction checks driving real key events (Tab, Enter, Space,\n  Escape, Arrow keys) through representative interactive widgets and\n  asserting the resulting accessible state (npm run test:keyboard).\n- An automated colour-contrast audit across every rendered\n  foreground/background combination.\n- Static accessibility lint (@angular-eslint) enforced as a build error in\n  both packages.\n\nBoth new gates use a standalone Playwright-based script rather than\n@storybook/test-runner, avoiding a dependency conflict with the monorepo''s\nexisting jest-based unit tests.\n\nPublishes ACCESSIBILITY.md, a conformance statement against WCAG 2.2 AA /\nEN 301 549 covering both packages: target and regulatory context, a\nDefinition of Done for interactive components, the verification methods and\ntooling above, a per-component conformance record, and known limitations.\n\nAlso includes a number of accessibility refinements found and fixed while\nbuilding out the automated coverage: colour-contrast adjustments to several\ndefault design tokens, accessible-name wiring for a few composed/dynamic\ncontrols, keyboard target-size and scrollable-region adjustments, and related\ncomponent-level fixes across both packages.\n\n* fix(accessibility): update sidebar-item color for better contrast and document known limitations\n\n* .\n\n* ci fix\n\n* fixes","tree":{"sha":"c6d4f9a2c93ba68c162fddcd5a1051aa0447fbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codearchitects/CodeArchitects.EnterprisePlatform.WebStack/git/trees/c6d4f9a2c93ba68c162fddcd5a1051aa0447fbcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codearchitects/CodeArchitects.EnterprisePlatform.WebStack/git/commits/411b991980d013ff9d2eebd156a51647804dd72a","verification":{"payload":"tree c6d4f9a2c93ba68c162fddcd5a1051aa0447fbcf\nparent 4a05b5a2ee834093db9bae440f1eb540f777875c\nauthor gmasci-ca <39516751+gmasci-ca@users.noreply.github.com> 1784220340 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784220340 +0200\n\nFeat/storybook (#7)\n\n* feat(storybook): add monorepo Storybook and broaden accessibility verification\n\nAdds a single monorepo Storybook instance (npm run storybook / build-storybook)\ndocumenting every component in @ca-webstack/ng-components and\n@ca-webstack/ng-components-extra, compiled from source and hosted from a new\nroot angular.json application project. Every component gets co-located\nstories covering its main use cases, controls, and autodocs.\n\nThe same stories back an automated accessibility test suite that runs in CI\non every change:\n- Structural checks via axe-core at WCAG 2.2 AA across every story\n  (npm run test:a11y).\n- Keyboard-interaction checks driving real key events (Tab, Enter, Space,\n  Escape, Arrow keys) through representative interactive widgets and\n  asserting the resulting accessible state (npm run test:keyboard).\n- An automated colour-contrast audit across every rendered\n  foreground/background combination.\n- Static accessibility lint (@angular-eslint) enforced as a build error in\n  both packages.\n\nBoth new gates use a standalone Playwright-based script rather than\n@storybook/test-runner, avoiding a dependency conflict with the monorepo''s\nexisting jest-based unit tests.\n\nPublishes ACCESSIBILITY.md, a conformance statement against WCAG 2.2 AA /\nEN 301 549 covering both packages: target and regulatory context, a\nDefinition of Done for interactive components, the verification methods and\ntooling above, a per-component conformance record, and known limitations.\n\nAlso includes a number of accessibility refinements found and fixed while\nbuilding out the automated coverage: colour-contrast adjustments to several\ndefault design tokens, accessible-name wiring for a few composed/dynamic\ncontrols, keyboard target-size and scrollable-region adjustments, and related\ncomponent-level fixes across both packages.\n\n* fix(accessibility): update sidebar-item color for better contrast and document known limitations\n\n* .\n\n* ci fix\n\n* fixes","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWQq0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi5gQADRb/hDJYUI+NIVgDbupglKW\n/SxmkRql/0ZpTOOZEidJbOyWJkrmNJK75BUFEgdVXZYx8hm3zG/VwebLbm11Upqi\nkBK9x7Arn7iBdLmVfanzWJaDYDC9EOEdfQP2vbwAF22BAJ6cO1kxY