/zensyh/spotea_mfe/commits/3606c20bdaa3529514da4101dfb85d07468f6503/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:03:15Z","email":"12.zeinirfansyah@gmail.com","name":"zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:03:15Z","email":"12.zeinirfansyah@gmail.com","name":"zen"},"message":"refactor [auth, api]: enhance authentication, token refresh, and error handling\n\n- Introduce `HttpError` and `handleApi` utility to centralize API route error management, replacing repetitive try-catch blocks.\n- Refactor API routes to use `requireSession()` for streamlined session validation and `protectedFetch()` for authenticated requests.\n- Implement a robust token refresh mechanism in `protectedFetch()`:\n    - Utilizes Redis locks to prevent thundering herd issues during token refresh.\n    - Adds polling with jitter and early exit on refresh failure for concurrent requests.\n    - Incorporates timeouts for refresh fetch operations.\n- Update admin routes to enforce role-based access control using `session.user.role` and `HttpError`.\n- Rename `authenticatedFetch` to `protectedFetch` for improved clarity.\n- Remove direct cookie extraction and session data retrieval from individual API routes.","tree":{"sha":"6af8ee916146680da6f9a0cf5c018d7a96f60f8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/git/trees/6af8ee916146680da6f9a0cf5c018d7a96f60f8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/git/commits/3606c20bdaa3529514da4101dfb85d07468f6503","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57295126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com