d5e0729b9571a283f48e499169085af4ea5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57295126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zensyh","id":57295126,"login":"zensyh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mjk1MTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zensyh/spotea_mfe/commit/c122d5e0729b9571a283f48e499169085af4ea5e","node_id":"C_kwDOTSGRJ9oAKGMxMjJkNWUwNzI5Yjk1NzFhMjgzZjQ4ZTQ5OTE2OTA4NWFmNGVhNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zensyh/spotea_mfe/commit/54d4ab71cab58c9f850623ecde72177a5df82d24","sha":"54d4ab71cab58c9f850623ecde72177a5df82d24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/commits/54d4ab71cab58c9f850623ecde72177a5df82d24"}],"sha":"c122d5e0729b9571a283f48e499169085af4ea5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/commits/c122d5e0729b9571a283f48e499169085af4ea5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57295126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zensyh","id":57295126,"login":"zensyh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mjk1MTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zensyh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/commits/5b00e20539f92ed654f9b8dc80969d57ab8679ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:35:47Z","email":"12.zeinirfansyah@gmail.com","name":"zen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:35:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #1 from zensyh/feat/authy\n\n## Ticket\n\n`[SPT_001] Authentication`\n\n## Ringkasan\n\nMerge ini menambahkan fondasi **authentication** untuk arsitektur micro-frontend (MFE),\nmencakup flow **login** dan **register**, session management berbasis **JWT cookie**,\nserta shared UI components baru. Login masih berstatus **WIP** (work in progress).\n\n## Pages (Route Baru)\n\n- `/login` — `apps/shell/src/app/login/page.tsx` *(WIP)*\n- `/register` — `apps/shell/src/app/register/page.tsx`\n\n## API Endpoints (Route Baru)\n\n- `POST /api/auth/login` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/login/route.ts` — validasi payload → forward ke backend, set cookie.\n- `POST /api/auth/register` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/register/route.ts` — registrasi user baru + validasi schema.\n- `GET /api/auth/me` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/me/route.ts` — ambil data user aktif dari session.\n- `POST /api/auth/logout` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/logout/route.ts` — clear session cookie.\n\n## Perubahan Utama\n\n### 1. Shared Auth Package — `packages/auth` (`@repo/auth`)\n- `src/session.ts` — `verifySession`, `getSession`, `requireSession` (verifikasi JWT via `jose`).\n- `src/cookie.ts` — `createSessionCookie` & `deleteSessionCookie` (HTTP-only, cookie: `spotea_token`, maxAge 7 hari).\n- `src/types.ts` — `User`, `Session`, `LoginPayload`, `RegisterPayload`, `AuthResponse`, `ApiError`.\n- `src/index.ts` — public exports package.\n\n### 2. Auth Features — `apps/shell/src/features/auth`\n- **Login** *(WIP)* — `login/`\n  - `login-page.tsx`, `components/form/login-form.tsx`, `hooks/use-login.ts`\n  - `form-model/login.schema.ts`, `form-model/default-value.ts`, `sections/login-banner.tsx`\n- **Register** — `register/`\n  - `register-page.tsx`, `components/form/register-form.tsx`, `hooks/use-register.ts`\n  - `form-model/register.schema.ts`, `form-model/default-value.ts`, `sections/register-banner.tsx`\n\n### 3. Shared Lib — `apps/shell/src/shared/lib`\n- `auth-store.ts` — state management via **Zustand** (`fetchMe`, `logout`, `user`, `loading`, `error`).\n- `fetcher.ts` — wrapper `fetch` + custom `ApiError` handling.\n- `format-zod-validation.ts` — utility format error Zod.\n- `resolve-role-home.ts` — redirect user ke app sesuai role (`customer` → `/consumer`, `merchant` → `/merchant`, `admin` → `/admin`).\n\n### 4. Shared UI Components — `packages/ui`\n- Komponen baru: `Badge`, `Card`, `Form`, `Input`, `Label`, `Separator`, `StatusDot`, `EditorialCard`, `OrnamentGrid`, `FieldError`.\n- Restruktur folder → `src/components/ui/*` untuk konsistensi.\n- Update `src/globals.css` dengan styling & variants baru.\n\n### 5. Dependencies & Config\n- Menambahkan: `react-hook-form`, `zod`, `zustand`, `jose`, dan utility lain.\n- Re-init lockfile (`bun.lock`), rename scope `@spotea` → `@repo` (menyentuh semua apps: `account`, `admin`, `consumer`, `merchant`, `shell`).\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `JWT_SECRET` — verifikasi & sign JWT session.\n- `BACKEND_API_URL` — base URL backend untuk auth request.\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` — resolve role home / redirect antar app.\n\n## Catatan / Perhatian\n\n- **Login flow masih WIP** — perlu review lebih lanjut sebelum dianggap final.\n- Scope package sudah di-rename dari `@spotea` → `@repo`, pastikan tidak ada referensi lama yang tertinggal.\n- Wajib set env vars di atas sebelum menjalankan app `shell`.","tree":{"sha":"27b0872cf1ca776b6674fe2d34b556935e0a860c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/git/trees/27b0872cf1ca776b6674fe2d34b556935e0a860c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zensyh/spotea_mfe/git/commits/5b00e20539f92ed654f9b8dc80969d57ab8679ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 27b0872cf1ca776b6674fe2d34b556935e0a860c\nparent 09a98d48ee840416eecf79b6c49ac9e02ffc6926\nparent 54d4ab71cab58c9f850623ecde72177a5df82d24\nauthor zen <12.zeinirfansyah@gmail.com> 1783960547 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783960547 +0700\n\nMerge pull request #1 from zensyh/feat/authy\n\n## Ticket\n\n`[SPT_001] Authentication`\n\n## Ringkasan\n\nMerge ini menambahkan fondasi **authentication** untuk arsitektur micro-frontend (MFE),\nmencakup flow **login** dan **register**, session management berbasis **JWT cookie**,\nserta shared UI components baru. Login masih berstatus **WIP** (work in progress).\n\n## Pages (Route Baru)\n\n- `/login` — `apps/shell/src/app/login/page.tsx` *(WIP)*\n- `/register` — `apps/shell/src/app/register/page.tsx`\n\n## API Endpoints (Route Baru)\n\n- `POST /api/auth/login` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/login/route.ts` — validasi payload → forward ke backend, set cookie.\n- `POST /api/auth/register` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/register/route.ts` — registrasi user baru + validasi schema.\n- `GET /api/auth/me` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/me/route.ts` — ambil data user aktif dari session.\n- `POST /api/auth/logout` — `apps/shell/src/app/api/auth/logout/route.ts` — clear session cookie.\n\n## Perubahan Utama\n\n### 1. Shared Auth Package — `packages/auth` (`@repo/auth`)\n- `src/session.ts` — `verifySession`, `getSession`, `requireSession` (verifikasi JWT via `jose`).\n- `src/cookie.ts` — `createSessionCookie` & `deleteSessionCookie` (HTTP-only, cookie: `spotea_token`, maxAge 7 hari).\n- `src/types.ts` — `User`, `Session`, `LoginPayload`, `RegisterPayload`, `AuthResponse`, `ApiError`.\n- `src/index.ts` — public exports package.\n\n### 2. Auth Features — `apps/shell/src/features/auth`\n- **Login** *(WIP)* — `login/`\n  - `login-page.tsx`, `components/form/login-form.tsx`, `hooks/use-login.ts`\n  - `form-model/login.schema.ts`, `form-model/default-value.ts`, `sections/login-banner.tsx`\n- **Register** — `register/`\n  - `register-page.tsx`, `components/form/register-form.tsx`, `hooks/use-register.ts`\n  - `form-model/register.schema.ts`, `form-model/default-value.ts`, `sections/register-banner.tsx`\n\n### 3. Shared Lib — `apps/shell/src/shared/lib`\n- `auth-store.ts` — state management via **Zustand** (`fetchMe`, `logout`, `user`, `loading`, `error`).\n- `fetcher.ts` — wrapper `fetch` + custom `ApiError` handling.\n- `format-zod-validation.ts` — utility format error Zod.\n- `resolve-role-home.ts` — redirect user ke app sesuai role (`customer` → `/consumer`, `merchant` → `/merchant`, `admin` → `/admin`).\n\n### 4. Shared UI Components — `packages/ui`\n- Komponen baru: `Badge`, `Card`, `Form`, `Input`, `Label`, `Separator`, `StatusDot`, `EditorialCard`, `OrnamentGrid`, `FieldError`.\n- Restruktur folder → `src/components/ui/*` untuk konsistensi.\n- Update `src/globals.css` dengan styling & variants baru.\n\n### 5. Dependencies & Config\n- Menambahkan: `react-hook-form`, `zod`, `zustand`, `jose`, dan utility lain.\n- Re-init lockfile (`bun.lock`), rename scope `@spotea` → `@repo` (menyentuh semua apps: `account`, `admin`, `consumer`, `merchant`, `shell`).\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `JWT_SECRET` — verifikasi & sign JWT session.\n- `BACKEND_API_URL` — base URL backend untuk auth request.\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` — resolve role home / redirect antar app.\n\n## Catatan / Perhatian\n\n- **Log