commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:34:56Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:34:56Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"refactor(frontend): remove dead ReconcileView; CommitPlanView owns reconcile\n\nNothing rendered ReconcileView — CommitPlanView ships the reconcile UX.\nPorted its unique test coverage (toggle seeding from actualDone, local flip,\nsubmit payload + in-flight state, empty-week state) to CommitPlanView.test.\nOracle LOCK-02/FR-05 now assert CommitPlanView + useReconcilePlanMutation\ninstead of the dead filename.\n\nAlso drops oracle IMPACT-05 (time-to-plan vs 15Five): needs a pre-migration\nbaseline external to this system — moved to ASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md exclusions\nwith the real-world measurement recipe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df68b315afc65f41385738bc46d53c05ac63042d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/df68b315afc65f41385738bc46d53c05ac63042d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/ebf1cb6f15714fb0582ae599f5c0caf4f891827e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/ebf1cb6f15714fb0582ae599f5c0caf4f891827e","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGViZjFjYjZmMTU3MTRmYjA1ODJhZTU5OWY1YzBjYWY0Zjg5MTgyN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993","sha":"2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993"}],"sha":"ebf1cb6f15714fb0582ae599f5c0caf4f891827e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ebf1cb6f15714fb0582ae599f5c0caf4f891827e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:34:45Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:34:45Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"feat(backend): refuse DRAFT->LOCKED on an empty week server-side\n\nThe UI guard (LifecycleControls) runs on a stale read — a delete-last-commit\nracing LOCK could still seal an empty week, stranding it in RECONCILING with\nno UI path to RECONCILED. The check runs behind findPlanForUpdate''s row lock,\nso it sees the final commit set. Surfaces as 409 ILLEGAL_TRANSITION.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d31b5f649cf1b53b42338a97f36da91c3f08239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/7d31b5f649cf1b53b42338a97f36da91c3f08239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDJkZDg2YjBhZjJkM2Q4MjI0ODdiYzJkZThiODA5MWNhNzI5NGE5OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/cfa41f5db1f7535a94c2ba2eee2513f2188fa88c","sha":"cfa41f5db1f7535a94c2ba2eee2513f2188fa88c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/cfa41f5db1f7535a94c2ba2eee2513f2188fa88c"}],"sha":"2dd86b0af2d3d822487bc2de8b8091ca7294a993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/