mitRepo alone left the entity re-attached through the still-populated\ncollection, so the DELETE never stuck. E2E covers add → delete → gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cb9191db12c92a0901b0d503e572049040fed25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/3cb9191db12c92a0901b0d503e572049040fed25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/6707565493654c378330911ee7d2a0f93fe6d2d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/6707565493654c378330911ee7d2a0f93fe6d2d1","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDY3MDc1NjU0OTM2NTRjMzc4MzMwOTExZWU3ZDJhMGY5M2ZlNmQyZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890","sha":"17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890"}],"sha":"6707565493654c378330911ee7d2a0f93fe6d2d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/6707565493654c378330911ee7d2a0f93fe6d2d1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:33:40Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:33:40Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"feat(dashboard): week navigation — dashboard can page to prior weeks\n\nEvery dashboard endpoint was already isoWeek-parameterized; only the component\npinned getIsoWeek(). Reuses the plan page''s prev/next pattern so a manager can\nreview last week''s reconciled roll-up, not just the live week.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XeK8fgqQkiqNvf9fJwXMp9","tree":{"sha":"188f489df32ffeac66e0ef67639158173a84ec50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/188f489df32ffeac66e0ef67639158173a84ec50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDE3ZmRlOTQ5OGU2NjA3M2ZkMTc3NTNkMWQ0ZDEwNjY0YzcxNTI4OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6","sha":"fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6"}],"sha":"17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/17fde9498e66073fd17753d1d4d10664c7152890"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T21:25:43Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T21:25:43Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"fix(commit-ui): surface delete-commit failures instead of swallowing them\n\nThe X button fired the mutation and ignored the result, so a backend rejection\n(e.g. non-DRAFT plan) looked like a dead button. Delete now unwraps and shows\nthe same inline error affordance as save; error renders outside edit mode too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XeK8fgqQkiqNvf9fJwXMp9","tree":{"sha":"683232d5c7d4ca527c2e153e46d1ac37202950ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/683232d5c7d4ca527c2e153e46d1ac37202950ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGZjMzA4MDdjZjZkMzJlMTgzZmIyNGFiYjZmM2E4MDMxZjFlMjZmYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/79d3cba04ea14f78d0b7f56c30457073a429f25d","sha":"79d3cba04ea14f78d0b7f56c30457073a429f25d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/79d3cba04ea14f78d0b7f56c30457073a429f25d"}],"sha":"fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/fc30807cf6d32e183fb24abb6f3a8031f1e26fb6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/79d3cba04ea14f78d0b7f56c30457073a429f25d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:03:33Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:03:33Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"feat(dashboard): show actual commits under each supporting outcome in RCDO drilldown\n\nThe drilldown''s terminal level was a bare count pill; leadership couldn''t see the\nwork itself. The outcome-level aggregate query is now line-level (text, category,\nuserId) and co