ts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:59:38Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:59:38Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"fix(review): enforce real RCDO alignment metric, unwrap mutations, real health probe\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3916351fdbbc65fc7a813a964a6f1b2c453b12c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/f3916351fdbbc65fc7a813a964a6f1b2c453b12c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/01b28b73ea641276127fabe7b6d59911eed04c35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/01b28b73ea641276127fabe7b6d59911eed04c35","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDAxYjI4YjczZWE2NDEyNzYxMjdmYWJlN2I2ZDU5OTExZWVkMDRjMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2","sha":"f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2"}],"sha":"01b28b73ea641276127fabe7b6d59911eed04c35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/01b28b73ea641276127fabe7b6d59911eed04c35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:15:26Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:15:26Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"outlook_integration_builder: real Graph client + calendar signal (P0 TECH-10)\n\nReplaces the Outlook Graph port''s always-empty stub with a genuine, working\nclient: LiveOutlookGraphAdapter performs the OAuth2 client-credentials flow\nagainst Microsoft identity platform and calls real Graph endpoints\n(directReports for team lookups, calendarView for a new weekly\nmeeting-load signal), active only when outlook.graph.enabled=true so the\nintegration stays additive and the core lifecycle keeps working with it off\n(fail-safe default via StubOutlookGraphAdapter). Adds a self-scoped\nGET /api/outlook/signal endpoint and a frontend CalendarSignalCard that\nrenders nothing when the signal is unavailable/loading/erroring.\n\nVerified: mvn verify green (158/160 backend tests — 2 pre-existing\nTestcontainers/Docker-socket failures unrelated to this slice, JaCoCo 97%,\nSpotless/SpotBugs clean), yarn wc:test 53/53, npm run oracle 51 pass/0\nfail/6 skip (no regressions; TECH-10 assertions strengthened to prove the\nlive adapter, not just the stub, exists).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f301e805927487f378d56d8a88df0d98ac8d1c6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/f301e805927487f378d56d8a88df0d98ac8d1c6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGYzMDI3YWVjN2Q3ZTc2ZmMyNTllY2ZlMTNkNDYyZGQ2MTVlMWE3YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2","sha":"672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2"}],"sha":"f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/f3027aec7d7e76fc259ecfe13d462dd615e1a7b2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:44:41Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:44:41Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"fix(manager-dashboard): close carry-forward DRAFT gate, org-wide findAll(), dashboard cache tags\n\n- WeekPlanService.carryForward now rejects a non-DRAFT target plan (alignment_judge\n  P0): targetIsoWeek was an unconstrained request param, letting a caller name their\n  own LOCKED/RECONCILED week as the carry-forward target and grow its commit set\n  post-hoc, bypassing the requireDraftPlan gate every other commit-insertion path uses.\n- AlignmentService.getLeadershipAlignment no longer calls planRepo.findAll()\n  (pipeline_assertion_judge P1): it now pages through the existing\n  WeekPlanRepository.findByIsoWeek in bounded Pageable batches, filtering to the\n  requested week instead of loading every plan across every week/user into memory.\n- commit/api.ts and lifecycle/api.ts mutations now invalidate ManagerDashboard/\n  TeamAlignment/OrgAlignment tags alongside WeeklyPlan (pipeline_assertion_judge P1),\n  so dashboard/alignment reads bust cache after a commit write or lifecycle transition\n  instead of showing stale data.\n\nmvn test: 147/149 green (2 pre-existing Testcontainers/Docker-socket sandbox\nfailures, unrelated). vitest run: 42/42 green. npm run oracle: 51 pass/0 fail/6\nskip/0 todo (unchanged).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06bd3deebe995d2cbe9888f9203c6728dde3098f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/06bd3deebe995d2cbe9888f9203c6728dde3098f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDY3MjYzNWEyNzk2NzY4YmZlZDBlOWZjMTQzNDUxYTU5MTQ1YzA0ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5","sha":"537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5"}],"sha":"672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/672635a2796768bfed0e9fc143451a59145c04f2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:29:46Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:29:46Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"manager_dashboard_builder: remove now-dead DashboardStub.tsx\n\nFollow-up to 6d630dc — the file deletion (superseded by ManagerDashboard.tsx) was\nmissed when staging that commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"660ae9cbd9b797881de8f64706eb49a16ec0c01f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/660ae9cbd9b797881de8f64706eb49a16ec0c01f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDUzN2VlZGZlYzUyMjljMjU0MjBiOTNmZDBiZWEyODBiOTQ5ZThjZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3","sha":"6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3"}],"sha":"537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/537eedfec5229c25420b93fd0bea280b949e8cf5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:29:21Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:29:21Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"manager_dashboard_builder: real manager/org dashboard UI + leadership org roll-up\n\nDashboardStub.tsx was a literal \"Full implementation pending\" placeholder and its\nsibling api.ts called a route no controller served (404 on every load); the backend\nalso had no org-wide roll-up, only a per-manager team view, leaving R6''s leadership\nscope unreachable from the UI.\n\n- Backend: ManagerDashboardController/DashboardService/WeekPlanRepository gain a\n  Pageable, LEADERSHIP-gated GET /api/manager/dashboard/org roll-up alongside the\n  existing team roll-up; SecurityConfig adds a stricter matcher ahead of the broader\n  /api/manager/** rule so org-wide access requires LEADERSHIP, not just MANAGER.\n- Frontend: real ManagerDashboard.tsx (RollupTable + AlignmentReadBadge, Pageable\n  controls) replaces DashboardStub.tsx; dashboard/api.ts fixes the dead team-rollup\n  route and wires the previously-unused /api/alignment/manager|leadership reads.\n- Tests: DashboardServiceTest/ControllerTest/SecurityConfigTest (backend, org rollup\n  + leadership gate) and RollupTable/ManagerDashboard/api Vitest suites (frontend).\n- oracle/oracle.test.ts: strengthens FR-06/FR-07/PERF-04/IMPACT-01 with real\n  frontend-wiring assertions and adds NFR-ACCESS-03 for the new leadership gate;\n  ASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md updated to match (npm run oracle: 51 pass, 0 fail, 6 skipped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"335c86619fa94df7c3e6c430f5641baf6fcfacab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/335c86619fa94df7c3e6c430f5641baf6fcfacab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDZkNjMwZGNmMDA0MDY1YjY0M2JlNzQ5ZDE4MzJiN2Q5OTk2YjYxZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0","sha":"e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0"}],"sha":"6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/6d630dcf004065b643be749d1832b7d9996b61d3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:01:21Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:01:21Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"fix(lifecycle): resolve Flyway V4 boot collision + close RCDO drift/concurrency gaps\n\nGate findings (alignment_judge) against the lifecycle slice:\n\n- P0: removed untracked V4__fk_supporting_outcome.sql — a duplicate Flyway\n  version 4 (collided with V4__fix_supporting_outcome_pk_collision.sql) that\n  hard-failed Spring/Flyway startup (\"Found more than one migration with\n  version 4\"), so the documented `docker compose up` demo never booted. Its FK\n  was also design-breaking: it referenced supporting_outcome(id) after V4__fix\n  demoted id to a component of the composite UNIQUE, and would reject every\n  pre-LOCK commit insert — exactly the DB-FK tradeoff LOCK-01/FR-02 avoided in\n  favor of app-layer enforcement. Migration chain is now a clean single V4.\n\n- P1: track V2__seed_demo.sql and V3__fix_priority_type.sql so a clean clone\n  matches the working tree (checkout-vs-tree traceability).\n\n- P2: WeekPlanService.transition() LOCK path now re-validates every already-\n  attached commit against the just-frozen snapshot and refuses the LOCK cleanly\n  (InvalidSupportingOutcomeException -> 400) if an outcome was retired upstream\n  between preview and LOCK — no unlinked commit is sealed into an immutable week.\n\n- P2: GlobalExceptionHandler maps ObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException to a\n  clean 409 CONFLICT (CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION) instead of an opaque 500 when a\n  concurrent reconcile/transition loses the @Version optimistic lock.\n\nBehavioral tests: LifecycleStateMachineTest (drift reject + happy path),\nGlobalExceptionHandlerTest (409 mapping). Oracle regression guards added to\nLOCK-01 and FR-04. Backend mvn test 137/137 green (minus the 2 Testcontainers\nclasses this sandbox can''t run); npm run oracle 50 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9b85e1faf2adee7bde7123a9d806cc7a0757620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/b9b85e1faf2adee7bde7123a9d806cc7a0757620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGU4NTczNjY0N2Q3YmFhNjMyNmYxZTJhNTI4NDFlNzg3MTc4ZTQzYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43","sha":"9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43"}],"sha":"e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/e85736647d7baa6326f1e2a52841e787178e43c0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T04:41:41Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T04:41:41Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"lifecycle: reject duplicate reconcile commitId with clean 400, not 500\n\nClose the last open P2 gap on FR-05 (owned by lifecycle_builder). A\nduplicate commitId in a reconcile() request that still left the\ndeduplicated request set equal to the locked set (locked {A,B}, request\n[A,A,B]) slipped past the conservation check and then threw\nIllegalStateException (\"Duplicate key\") in Collectors.toMap -> HTTP 500.\n\nreconcile() now rejects a repeated commit result up front\n(requestedIds.size() != results.size()) via the new\nDuplicateReconcileResultException, mapped to 400 DUPLICATE_RECONCILE_RESULT\nin GlobalExceptionHandler. Proven by ReconciliationConservesSetTest +\nGlobalExceptionHandlerTest and oracle:FR-05''s new structural assertions;\nFR-05 moves partial -> implemented.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf35a8aed1e47e2034cef902423b6dfa337526bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/bf35a8aed1e47e2034cef902423b6dfa337526bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDljNjE3MGMwZWUxNDExNjEyNGYzMDcyZThjODYyN2NjMjVhMzRiNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c","sha":"bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c"}],"sha":"9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/9c6170c0ee14116124f3072e8c8627cc25a34b43"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T04:30:08Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T04:30:08Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"fix: close RCDO snapshot PK collision, LOCKED-concurrency, reconciliation-bypass, and carry-forward gaps\n\nGate-response fixes for weekly_commit_builder''s slice (alignment_judge, 2026-06-30):\n\n- P0: supporting_outcome.id was a global PRIMARY KEY holding a source-of-record id\n  that recurs across every week''s snapshot by design, so the second distinct week\n  to LOCK re-inserted the same ids and threw a DataIntegrityViolationException,\n  permanently blocking DRAFT->LOCKED. Fixed with a surrogate `pk` primary key plus\n  a (rcdo_snapshot_id, id) unique constraint (V4 migration).\n\n- P1: WeekPlanEntity had no optimistic-lock column, and WeeklyCommitService''s DRAFT\n  check raced WeekPlanService''s DRAFT->LOCKED write under READ_COMMITTED. Fixed with\n  a pessimistic row lock (WeekPlanRepository.findByIdForUpdate) taken by both flows,\n  plus a @Version column as defense in depth (V5 migration).\n\n- P1: RECONCILING->RECONCILED was reachable via the generic transition() endpoint\n  without ever running reconcile()''s locked-set conservation check. Fixed: transition()\n  now refuses that edge; reconcile() performs the state flip itself once conservation\n  is verified.\n\n- P2: carryForward copied a commit''s supportingOutcomeId into the new week without\n  re-validating it against the target week''s RCDO read. Fixed: every carried commit\n  is now re-validated via assertValidSupportingOutcome before being attached.\n\nAdded two Testcontainers-backed integration tests (RcdoSnapshotLockPersistenceTest,\nWeekPlanConcurrentLockTest) that prove the first two fixes against a real Postgres\ncontainer; they compile and pass mvn test-compile but could not execute in this\nsandboxed environment due to a docker-java/Docker-Desktop socket incompatibility.\nmvn verify (Spotless + SpotBugs + JaCoCo >=80%, actual 97%) is green with 132/132\ntests passing; npm run oracle is unchanged at 50 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip / 0 todo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ff8a0ebe285f6a04722f3b7501f6183f04f99ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/3ff8a0ebe285f6a04722f3b7501f6183f04f99ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGJkNmI2N2E1MmYyMWVlNjU5NGUxMTkyYjE4ZDI1YWUxNjRiNzE5MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138","sha":"c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138"}],"sha":"bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/bd6b67a52f21ee6594e1192b18d25ae164b7190c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T04:00:16Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T04:00:16Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"weekly_commit_builder: close local-profile JWT superuser bypass (access_shield P0)\n\nLocalSecurityConfig''s JwtDecoder ignored the presented token entirely and minted\nevery caller a fixed sub=local-user principal with permissions=[LEADERSHIP,\nMANAGER, IC] — an org-wide superuser grant under the `local` profile, which is\nthe offline demo''s de-facto run mode (the default decoder eagerly fetches OIDC\nmetadata and fails to boot without a reachable Auth0 issuer). Default grant is\nnow IC-only, with elevation only via an explicit LOCAL_AUTH_PERMISSIONS opt-in;\ndocker-compose.yml now publishes the backend port as 127.0.0.1-only and makes\nSPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local explicit instead of an undocumented prerequisite.\n\nAlso adds a startup warning when SecurityConfig''s aud-claim validation is\nskipped against a non-stub issuer (P2, already accepted per ADR-0001 but now\nsurfaced in logs instead of only a code comment).\n\nProven by LocalSecurityConfigTest.java (4 cases) and a new oracle:NFR-ACCESS-02\nstructural regression guard. mvn test: 130/130 green (126 -> 130). npm run\noracle: 50 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip (was 49/0/6).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bea4a22d4c59ac2cbcbe106841dc4efdd5a82ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/2bea4a22d4c59ac2cbcbe106841dc4efdd5a82ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGM0NGZkMTA4MmY5YzUwMjBmYzNhNzg4OTg3ZmE5Y2ZhOTVhMDUxMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70","sha":"ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70"}],"sha":"c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/c44fd1082f9c5020fc3a788987fa9cfa95a05138"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T03:44:30Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T03:44:30Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"weekly_commit_builder: fix PATCH /commits validation 500, add coverage\n\nUpdateCommitRequest.priority was declared `@Min(1) @Max(5) Optional<Integer>`\n— a constraint annotation on the container type Hibernate Validator has no\nvalidator for, so every PATCH /api/plans/{planId}/commits/{commitId} request\nthrew jakarta.validation.UnexpectedTypeException (500) before the controller\nmethod, and therefore AccessGuard, ever ran. Fixed by moving the constraints\nonto the container element (Optional<@Min(1) @Max(5) Integer>), the Bean\nValidation 2.0 syntax Hibernate Validator''s built-in Optional value extractor\nunwraps automatically.\n\nAdds the PATCH IDOR test WeeklyCommitControllerSecurityTest previously\ncouldn''t write until this bug was fixed, plus valid/invalid-priority cases\nproving 200/400/200 instead of a blanket 500. mvn test: 126/126 green.\nnpm run oracle: 49 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip, no regressions.\n\nReviewed the rest of the weekly-commit CRUD + chess-layer slice\n(WeeklyCommitController/Service/Repository, CreateCommitRequest, ChessCategory,\napps/wc/src/features/commit/*) already built by prior sessions and confirmed\nit satisfies FR-02/FR-03 with mandatory server-side Supporting-Outcome\nvalidation and category/priority chess layer; ASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md''s known-gaps\ntable updated to move this row from open to resolved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee584f5d0d41eb72c6c7d59d6e5898ca5ca1064a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/ee584f5d0d41eb72c6c7d59d6e5898ca5ca1064a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGZmMDQzYzNkNTI0YzNkNmQwMzJjNGE0MThlNjRkMjUzYzg2ZDhiNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d","sha":"ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d"}],"sha":"ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ff043c3d524c3d6d032c4a418e64d253c86d8b70"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T03:29:43Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T03:29:43Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"rcdo_adapter_builder: fix RCDO snapshot id drift and enforce link validity (gate P0s)\n\nRcdoService.ensureSnapshot regenerated a fresh persistence id for every Supporting\nOutcome at LOCK instead of keeping the source-of-record id, so a commit''s\nsupportingOutcomeId (captured pre-LOCK from the live/preview read) could never\nmatch a row in its own week''s frozen snapshot. SupportingOutcomeEntity.id is now\nan assigned id and ensureSnapshot passes dto.id() through explicitly.\n\nWeeklyCommitService.create/update also persisted supportingOutcomeId verbatim\nwith no lookup, so any UUID was accepted as \"linked\" regardless of validity.\nAdded RcdoService.assertValidSupportingOutcome(isoWeek, id), checked against the\nsame getOrPreviewSnapshot read the frontend selector renders, wired into\ncreate/update, with a new InvalidSupportingOutcomeException -> 400 mapping.\nAs a side effect this also closes the global-snapshot drift window: once a\nsnapshot exists for a week, every drafter''s preview and every commit''s\nvalidation read the same frozen set.\n\nHardened oracle:LOCK-01/FR-02 with structural assertions for both fixes, and\nfixed oracle:TECH-07''s ambiguous SecurityConfig.java suffix match (was picking\nup LocalSecurityConfig.java depending on directory order). npm run oracle: 49\npass / 0 fail / 6 skip. mvn test: 123/123 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f515c6c36163f6aee7f3937396f6d98d0b12aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/2f515c6c36163f6aee7f3937396f6d98d0b12aa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGFiMTY2Mzk3ZTYxN2E5ZjhiMzkwZWVhZGE0OTAwOWQzNjVhNDg1M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11","sha":"e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11"}],"sha":"ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/ab166397e617a9f8b390eeada49009d365a4853d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T03:09:36Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T03:09:36Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"rcdo_adapter_builder: hybrid live-preview + frozen-snapshot RCDO read\n\nRcdoService.getOrPreviewSnapshot(isoWeek) is the actual hybrid read the PRD''s\nlocked decision describes: once a week is LOCKED (ensureSnapshot has run),\nreturn the frozen, persisted snapshot; otherwise read live from\nRcdoSourcePort without persisting, so an IC can select a Supporting Outcome\nbefore any snapshot row exists (previously impossible pre-LOCK).\n\nFixes a live route mismatch: frontend/src/features/rcdo/api.ts''s RTK Query\nslice called GET /api/rcdo/{isoWeek}, but RcdoController only served\n/api/rcdo/snapshot/{isoWeek} — every load 404''d. Wired the new hybrid method\nto the route the frontend actually calls; the old /snapshot and /outcomes\nroutes stay for explicit frozen-only reads.\n\nAdds real coverage: RcdoServiceTest (frozen-vs-preview branches),\nControllerTest (delegation), and a new Vitest suite asserting the RTK Query\nslice hits the exact /api/rcdo/{isoWeek} URL, passes through the response,\nand tags the cache by isoWeek (works around a jsdom/undici AbortSignal\nclass mismatch by running under the node test environment with a minimal\nRequest stand-in). Backend: 117/117 JUnit green. Frontend: 15/15 Vitest\ngreen, tsc/eslint clean. oracle: 49 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip (no regressions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e707c7c833f68f320f5c56f40558bb2bcc9dae0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/e707c7c833f68f320f5c56f40558bb2bcc9dae0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGU3NzQ0YTA5YmU0YWQ4NTA5YTkyYzVjMjdlZjhiYWQ1NjliZTNmMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46","sha":"edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46"}],"sha":"e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/e7744a09be4ad8509a92c5c27ef8bad569be3f11"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:49:37Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:49:37Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"auth_access_builder: verify security slice against gate findings; sync test-count note\n\nRe-verified TECH-07/NFR-ACCESS-01 against the 2026-06-30 gate pass: the four flagged\nfindings (missing Supporting-Outcome FK, WeekPlanEntity TOCTOU, reconcile-bypass on\nRECONCILING->RECONCILED, AlignmentService linkedPct tautology) all fall outside\nbackend/security per their own stated owners (weekly_commit_builder, lifecycle_builder,\nmanager_dashboard_builder) and were left untouched to respect ROSTER §5 slice\nboundaries. `mvn test` (114/114 green, incl. all com.pa.wc.security.* IDOR/JWT/role\nsuites) and `npm run oracle` (49 pass / 0 fail / 6 skipped, no regressions) confirm the\nAuth0 JWT + AccessGuard scoping slice is unaffected; synced the stale test-count note in\nASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md''s TECH-07 row to match.","tree":{"sha":"0f563f31ff173cf12369b7c874ed39fb0927bef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/0f563f31ff173cf12369b7c874ed39fb0927bef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKGVkZDc2NjkzY2M2YWFjYmFjODI0NmI0ZDg5NDhhYzA5MjJmN2FkNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797","sha":"5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797"}],"sha":"edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/edd76693cc6aacbac8246b4d8948ac0922f7ad46"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:40:35Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:40:35Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"fix(auth): close weekly-commit horizontal IDOR (access_shield P0)\n\nWeeklyCommitController invoked no AccessGuard on any route, so any\nauthenticated caller could read/write/delete another user''s weekly\ncommits by planId/commitId alone. Every handler now resolves the\nplan owner via WeekPlanService and asserts self/read scope through\nAccessGuard before touching WeeklyCommitService, mirroring\nWeekPlanController. Proven end-to-end by\nWeeklyCommitControllerSecurityTest.java (real SecurityConfig filter\nchain) and unit-level by ControllerTest; oracle:NFR-ACCESS-01 now\nscans WeeklyCommitController too. Also documents a pre-existing,\nout-of-slice UpdateCommitRequest validation bug (500 on every PATCH)\ndiscovered while adding this coverage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46d82c9509c5a19d1ca99c2657e2295369e145f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/46d82c9509c5a19d1ca99c2657e2295369e145f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDU5MTdjMDZhMGY4NDRiMTJhMDNkYjFjYjY0ODg5ZjlkZWNjYjU3OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b","sha":"7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b"}],"sha":"5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/5917c06a0f844b12a03db1cb64889f9deccb5797"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:24:57Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:24:57Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"auth_access_builder: JWT role mapping, aud validation, server-side IDOR guard\n\nCloses the auth_access_builder rows in ASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md''s known-gaps table:\nRolesJwtAuthenticationConverter maps Auth0''s `permissions` claim (IC/MANAGER/\nLEADERSHIP) to ROLE_* authorities; SecurityConfig gates the real leadership\nroute (/api/alignment/leadership, previously falling through to bare\nauthenticated()) and manager routes on those roles, and validates the `aud`\nclaim when AUTH0_AUDIENCE is set. New AccessGuard reconciles every client-\nsupplied userId/managerId against the JWT subject (IC -> self, MANAGER -> own\nteam via OutlookGraphPort, LEADERSHIP -> org) instead of trusting request\nparams, closing the horizontal-IDOR gap across WeekPlanController,\nAlignmentController, and ManagerDashboardController; denials surface as a 403\nvia a new GlobalExceptionHandler mapping.\n\nTECH-07 flips partial -> implemented and a new NFR-ACCESS-01 row is added,\nboth backed by real behavioral tests (RolesJwtAuthenticationConverterTest,\nCurrentUserTest, AccessGuardTest, SecurityConfigTest via MockMvc + Spring\nSecurity Test) rather than structural-only checks — confirmed by installing\na JDK 21 the parent pom''s release target actually matches and running\n`mvn test` (108/108 green) instead of relying on stale \"no JVM\" caveats.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97e5340da952c7134fdac827fe05f65bcb29c7d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/97e5340da952c7134fdac827fe05f65bcb29c7d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDdlMjZmZTcwM2IzYzUxOGM3NzJhZjAxYjBkNDU4NzYzY2JjODc1MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a","sha":"1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a"}],"sha":"7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/7e26fe703b3c518c772af01b0d458763cbc8750b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T01:55:08Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T01:55:08Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"mfe_platform_builder: fix flagged gate findings in platform slice\n\n- contracts/api.ts now re-exports packages/contract/src/index.ts instead of\n  hand-rolling a second, divergent DTO/route contract (wrong ChessCategory\n  values, a LOCKED->DRAFT unlock edge the backend correctly rejects). Two\n  files both claiming \"single source of truth\" that disagreed is fixed by\n  eliminating the duplicate, guarded by a new oracle:CONTRACT-01 test.\n- apps/wc/src/store/api.ts: wcApi''s fetchBaseQuery now attaches a Bearer\n  token via prepareHeaders, sourced from new apps/wc/src/store/auth.ts (a\n  token-accessor the PA host wires post-mount, falling back to a\n  localStorage token for standalone runs) — closes the gap where every\n  RTK Query call carried no Authorization header.\n- docker-compose.yml: DB_PASSWORD/DB_USER/DB_NAME are now env-overridable\n  (${VAR:-wc}) instead of hardcoded, matching the existing\n  AUTH0_ISSUER_URI pattern; local `docker compose up` is unaffected.\n- ASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md updated to reflect the fixes and the fuller set of\n  gate findings from the latest pass (oracle: 48 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a53c1d73e34c5cb1c8fdb2513e213dc8f1cb5042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/a53c1d73e34c5cb1c8fdb2513e213dc8f1cb5042"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDFlMDk4ZjY2NGI1MmI3MzE4OTA4NmQ0MjYzNDA0MDAxZTkzYzI1M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19","sha":"280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19"}],"sha":"1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/1e098f664b52b73189086d4263404001e93c253a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T01:38:53Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T01:38:53Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"Restore backend/infra/contract traceability; sync assessment oracle to reality\n\nFixes the pipeline_assertion_judge P1 gate finding: the prior mfe_platform_builder\ncommit (1b49470) shipped only apps/wc + root config + docker-compose.yml, leaving\nservices/backend/{pom.xml,src}, infra/ (Pulumi), packages/contract, and docs/ fully\nuntracked. On a clean checkout of that commit the oracle''s backend/entity/off-limits\nscans passed vacuously (0 Java files). This commit brings the tracked tree in line\nwith what''s actually built, and updates ASSESSMENT_ORACLE.md''s status/notes/coverage\nsummary to match the now-real `npm run oracle` output (47 pass / 0 fail / 6 skip, up\nfrom 22/31), including a new Known-gaps table so the outstanding P0/P1 findings from\nthis gate pass (RCDO FK validation, alignment-metric tautology, authz gaps, bypassable\nreconciliation, contracts/api.ts vs packages/contract drift — all outside\nmfe_platform_builder''s ownership per persona) stay tracked instead of silently\ndisappearing.\n\napps/wc, root workspace config, services/backend/pom.xml, and docker-compose.yml\n(mfe_platform_builder''s own slice) were re-verified: typecheck/lint/vitest/oracle all\ngreen, no changes needed — the gate pass raised no findings against this slice itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d0d0461e19b0159743bfa400e8612a97685b0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/0d0d0461e19b0159743bfa400e8612a97685b0a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDI4MGFlOGY4YTEwZmQ5NWI3ZWZjMGI1MTVjMDJhNTc1MDNkZTJmMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee","sha":"1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee"}],"sha":"280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/280ae8f8a10fd95b7efc0b515c02a57503de2f19"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T01:19:56Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T01:19:56Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"Add mfe_platform_builder slice: Vite MF remote, workspace config, Postgres compose\n\n- apps/wc: standalone-capable Vite 5 + React 18 remote with a single Module\n  Federation entry point (./App), react/react-dom/react-redux/@reduxjs-toolkit\n  declared as MF shared deps, RTK Query base api (wcApi) + Redux store, Tailwind\n  + Flowbite React, ESLint 9 + Prettier 3.3, Vitest. No hardcoded shell/nav —\n  MemoryRouter so the host owns the real URL. Subpath-imported flowbite-react\n  components to cut the lazy route chunk from 507KB to 150KB raw.\n- Root workspace: yarn workspaces (apps/*, packages/*), tsconfig.base.json +\n  root tsconfig.json (strict mode), nx.json + apps/wc/project.json for the\n  Nx + Yarn Workspaces monorepo requirement.\n- docker-compose.yml: local Postgres 16.4 (db/user/pass `wc`, matches\n  services/backend''s application.yml) + a backend service building\n  services/backend/Dockerfile; verified the Postgres container starts healthy\n  and provisions the expected database.\n- oracle/oracle.test.ts: fixed a path-join bug in the `read()` helper that\n  threw ENOENT once TSCONFIGS/JAVA_FILES/VITE_CONFIGS were non-empty (added\n  `readAbs` for already-absolute paths), and flipped LOCK-03, PERF-02/03,\n  CQ-01/05/06, TECH-02/03/06/08, OFFLIMITS-05, DEPLOY-01/02/03 from skip\n  stubs to real behavioral checks. `npm run oracle`: 22 pass, 0 fail,\n  31 skipped (documented reasons), 0 todo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d42a8579c33e4415eddb74148733f218520bfd69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/trees/d42a8579c33e4415eddb74148733f218520bfd69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/git/commits/1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee","node_id":"C_kwDOTSP-NtoAKDFiNDk0NzBkNzcyZDliMDQzNzhkN2Q4MDViN2YzZmJmYjFiNTYwZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commit/4eb96bcd13a325f99636708131173e9511b672e6","sha":"4eb96bcd13a325f99636708131173e9511b672e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/4eb96bcd13a325f99636708131173e9511b672e6"}],"sha":"1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/1b49470d772d9b04378d7d805b7f3fbfb1b560ee"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victorrent/wc-strategic-weekly-planning/commits/4eb96bcd13a325f99636708131173e9511b672e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T00:39:36Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T00:39:36Z","email":"victor.rojas@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"Victor Rojas"},"message":"Planning phase: PRD/ROSTER agent blueprints, IaC ADR, assessment oracle, boundary contract\n\nRuns architecture-tradeoffs (Pulumi/TS, deliverable-only IaC), assessment-oracle\n(53-row requirement->check mapping, npm run oracle), and the batched-fork + boundary\ncontract steps of prd-compile. Build scope: Outlook Graph integration promoted P0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree