,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi","id":124247791,"login":"samakshrastogi","node_id":"U_kgDOB2fe7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/91648da7cc3be6f0eab735294e05a8f26b797616/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T01:37:05Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T01:37:05Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"message":"fix(cors): align SK Central with cross-platform SSO origins\n\nExpand the configured SK Central browser allowlist with canonical and www SK ecosystem origins so the deployed SK Quiz frontend can request credentialed app tokens without weakening origin validation.\n\nNormalize trailing slashes, derive safe sk-hub.in hostname aliases, retain environment-configured origins, allow non-browser service requests, and reject unrelated domains with an explicit CORS error.\n\nApply the same resolved origins to Socket.IO, keeping realtime connections consistent with the HTTP API and the SK Quiz service integration contract.","tree":{"sha":"236bf9233e657dbfc6999479cbfcdda2a853a5a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/trees/236bf9233e657dbfc6999479cbfcdda2a853a5a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/commits/91648da7cc3be6f0eab735294e05a8f26b797616","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u