crolling inside the reading surface.\n\nHide sidebar and article scrollbar chrome, narrow the application rail, reduce card radii and padding, and tighten Markdown typography, headings, lists, tables, and table-of-contents controls so more useful content fits on screen.\n\nCompact Mermaid diagrams with smaller labels, reduced node and rank spacing, minimal diagram padding, responsive full-width SVG sizing, and a capped visual height for easier whole-flow scanning.\n\nRemove expanded-preview state, body scroll locking, expand and close icons, and all related CSS so Share remains the sole flowchart action.","tree":{"sha":"3eb40ac9f2cd3f1a625145059f03fafa03124bfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/trees/3eb40ac9f2cd3f1a625145059f03fafa03124bfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/commits/86ac10f6cba910689cc1505f3d821a9c4b5f8c5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124247791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi","id":124247791,"login":"samakshrastogi","node_id":"U_kgDOB2fe7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commit/86ac10f6cba910689cc1505f3d821a9c4b5f8c5c","node_id":"C_kwDOTSWPsdoAKDg2YWMxMGY2Y2JhOTEwNjg5Y2MxNTA1ZjNkODIxYTljNGI1ZjhjNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commit/fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7","sha":"fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7"}],"sha":"86ac10f6cba910689cc1505f3d821a9c4b5f8c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/86ac10f6cba910689cc1505f3d821a9c4b5f8c5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124247791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi","id":124247791,"login":"samakshrastogi","node_id":"U_kgDOB2fe7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:10:57Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:10:57Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"message":"fix: render shared flowcharts in a focused documentation viewer\n\nRemove the documentation hero, launch metadata, active README strip, and reading-progress UI so Markdown content begins immediately in the preview surface.\n\nRender every Mermaid source block explicitly as SVG, normalize unicode arrows, preserve the original branching graph structure, and show a clear syntax message when a diagram cannot be parsed.\n\nReplace the Markdown copy action with Web Share support that sends the current documentation URL and an SK ecosystem message, with a clipboard fallback on unsupported browsers.\n\nKeep the global SK Central top bar visible in expanded mode while the documentation preview fills the remaining viewport, lock background scrolling, and replace the expand control with an X close icon while active.","tree":{"sha":"64379cea45001b59c1c94fd7ba4fea1d26ca99e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/trees/64379cea45001b59c1c94fd7ba4fea1d26ca99e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/commits/fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124247791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi","id":124247791,"login":"samakshrastogi","node_id":"U_kgDOB2fe7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commit/fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7","node_id":"C_kwDOTSWPsdoAKGZkNzE4YWEyNTMyMDA5ZWUzN2IyYmE1YjM0Nzg5NzZiZmJlMmRjYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commit/b92a82bff03987b71a0b8bbcecdbe7ec2de76cae","sha":"b92a82bff03987b71a0b8bbcecdbe7ec2de76cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/b92a82bff03987b71a0b8bbcecdbe7ec2de76cae"}],"sha":"fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/fd718aa2532009ee37b2ba5b3478976bfbe2dca7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124247791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samakshrastogi","id":124247791,"login":"samakshrastogi","node_id":"U_kgDOB2fe7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/b92a82bff03987b71a0b8bbcecdbe7ec2de76cae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:41:19Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:41:19Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"message":"feat: align documentation preview with GitHub and sync profile avatars\n\nReplace the hand-built flowchart approximation with Mermaid, the diagram engine used by GitHub Markdown previews. Render the original graph structure as responsive SVG with rectangular themed nodes, curved branch connectors, secure parsing, copy-source controls, and an expanded reading mode.\n\nRecognize ordered Markdown lists in the table of contents, strip repeated numeric and heading prefixes, and render a single canonical number and label for each anchor.\n\nRemove the redundant Section 1 control for single-document applications. For multi-file documentation, show GitHub-style filename tabs and reset reading progress when switching files.\n\nUse the persisted profile image or custom initials in the application top bar so avatar changes immediately stay consistent with the profile page across navigation and reloads.\n\nLazy-load Mermaid only for documents containing diagrams and update the dependency lockfile for reproducible builds.","tree":{"sha":"6ea74cce00f8b6c2bcc1b5b223095ffbf8064497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/trees/6ea74cce00f8b6c2bcc1b5b223095ffbf8064497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/git/commits/b92a82bff03987b71a0b8bbcecdbe7ec2de76cae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124247791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sam