s/samakshrastogi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samakshrastogi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samakshrastogi/SK-Central/commits/2dcac95dbfda3c28485eadad8254c12df26db8ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:19:27Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:19:27Z","email":"124247791+samakshrastogi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Samaksh Rastogi"},"message":"feat: deliver realtime insights and polished SK identity experiences\n\nRefresh identity and SK Quiz analytics every five seconds while maintaining a monotonic per-second active-time counter between server heartbeats, with a visible live-sync indicator.\n\nPersist project create, update, and delete actions in the identity audit log; refresh audit data automatically and after mutations; and present complete admin history in a structured, searchable-friendly table with actor, target, action, and details.\n\nRedesign SK Auth OTP emails with a responsive branded security card, clearer verification/reset context, prominent one-time code, expiry guidance, and matching plain-text fallback.\n\nNormalize generated documentation TOC labels so numbering appears once, add document identity and reading progress, and improve flowchart readability with responsive light canvases, step labels, elevated nodes, and clearer visual hierarchy.\n\nEnhance profiles with role and active-status badges, completion scoring, personalized guidance, and stronger identity presentation.","tree":{"sha":"44e86a7fd5097f79e69c170430067a54645f0250","