lan, is cancelled\nwith a recorded reason instead of staying in progress. The Plan of a superseded\ngeneration can also be cancelled on its own.\n\nCorpus submodule: refile facets of a moved thread, relink a thread whose Plan is cancelled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5741a2bf2b648b9c0fddfb9d6b640a0be89a9f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/trees/d5741a2bf2b648b9c0fddfb9d6b640a0be89a9f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/commits/67a5880b5643d09e1d36aa7b753ce2af8f455c4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/67a5880b5643d09e1d36aa7b753ce2af8f455c4c","node_id":"C_kwDOTSYOddoAKDY3YTU4ODBiNTY0M2QwOWUxZDM2YWE3Yjc1M2NlMmFmOGY0NTVjNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039","sha":"07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039"}],"sha":"67a5880b5643d09e1d36aa7b753ce2af8f455c4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/67a5880b5643d09e1d36aa7b753ce2af8f455c4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:49:43Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:49:43Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"message":"Runtime: stop a started mission with a reason\n\nA declaration replacement that carries missionRemovalReason stops each accepted\nmission it omits, until the child Plan is COMPLETE. A running Attempt is\ninterrupted and the child Plan with its descendants becomes CANCELLED with the\nreason. The Plan read lists the stopped missions. Without a reason the removal\nrules are unchanged.\n\nCorpus submodule: framework 0.6.0 for a thread that evolves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28e440e165590176aca5f3b75d37b3d788d2984f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/trees/28e440e165590176aca5f3b75d37b3d788d2984f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/commits/07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039","node_id":"C_kwDOTSYOddoAKDA3ZjRkNmNiNTcyMDEzOTc2ZTYxNDIwZmM4OWMyNWM2ZWYxZjUwMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6","sha":"8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6"}],"sha":"07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/07f4d6cb572013976e61420fc89c25c6ef1f5039"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:37:58Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:37:58Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"message":"Runtime: cancel a root Plan with a reason\n\nA cancelled Plan has the terminal work state CANCELLED with its date, author\nand reason. Its current child Plans are cancelled with it, its session is\nclosed and its pending Attempts are interrupted. It refuses further Attempts,\ndeclarations, resume and relaunch; everything stays readable. RPC plan.cancel,\nMCP trust_plan_cancel and trust_plan_list, work state filter on the Plan list.\nSchema version 5 with a guarded migration from version 4.\n\nThread trust-plan-cancellation (fil 26), TRUST-FR-PCN-010 and TRUST-FR-PCN-020.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbbc51757284c6e9ec2b790122cd1d6db551881e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/trees/bbbc51757284c6e9ec2b790122cd1d6db551881e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/commits/8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6","node_id":"C_kwDOTSYOddoAKDhjNGU2ZmRjMmM2ZTBmYTRlZmY5ZWQxNjA3N2RlMGY3OGIyNTIwYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/3db525506bdfa28fb403c6c5f3803710e02a4784","sha":"3db525506bdfa28fb403c6c5f3803710e02a4784","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/3db525506bdfa28fb403c6c5f3803710e02a4784"}],"sha":"8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/8c4e6fdc2c6e0fa4eff9ed16077de0f78b2520c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/3db525506bdfa28fb403c6c5f3803710e02a4784/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:57:22Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:57:22Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"message":"Runtime: a mission is removable until an Attempt gives a verdict\n\nAn Attempt blocks the removal of its mission only when it is finalized, or\npending before its expiry. An Attempt that failed before any verdict no\nlonger keeps an unrunnable mission in its collection.\n\nThread corpus-workspace-explorer (fil 21), revision 11, TRUST-FR-CXP-240.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c97a83ba34026a88b64fe8f48d87326293878d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/trees/c97a83ba34026a88b64fe8f48d87326293878d16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/commits/3db525506bdfa28fb403c6c5f3803710e02a4784","verification":{"payload":null