tent.\n- trust rpc calls the runtime without hand-written JSON-RPC.\n- README.md, QUICKSTART.md and the agent install guide; the quickstart\n  acceptance runs QUICKSTART.md literally from the packed tarball.\n- Extension asset failures answer a JSON 404 like other extension routes.\n- MIT license.\n\nThread trust-npm-distribution (TRUST-FR-DIST-010, 020, 030).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e51d711a54adb9e6d10a0850b7980dacd80b502e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/trees/e51d711a54adb9e6d10a0850b7980dacd80b502e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/commits/3e3be32c301ab7358864bbd44e56b26e2125ed6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33391039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien","id":33391039,"login":"ng-galien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzkxMDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/3e3be32c301ab7358864bbd44e56b26e2125ed6b","node_id":"C_kwDOTSYOddoAKDNlM2JlMzJjMzAxYWI3MzU4ODY0YmJkNDRlNTZiMjZlMjEyNWVkNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ng-galien/trust/commit/4