.com/users/ng-galien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ng-galien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/commits/20a8e42158b7a82229783aab405908671990a987/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:17:10Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:17:10Z","email":"33391039+ng-galien@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexandre Boyer"},"message":"feat: delegate Environment credentials, extension registry and mission relaunch\n\nOperations declare Credentials and reference them from an HTTP header, a PostgreSQL connection or one\nShell step. Admission delegates only the declared names in a separate credentials map; the Runner gives\neach value to its step only, masks it everywhere and no longer reads PGPASSWORD, password files or URL\npasswords. Environment credentials are sealed at rest with AES-256-GCM under an owner-only key file.\n\nAdd extension settings and installation lifecycle, the registry v2 with git, HTTP and file sources and\npackage install, update and uninstall. An operator can relaunch an escalated child Plan as the next\ngeneration of the same invocation; coordination missions follow the relaunched Plan. Coordination\nmission Operations 1.1.0 authenticate with a Credential.\n\nPlan reads no longer serialize behind writers or reload the whole revision history, and batch the\nlatest Snapshot and Attempt per Plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31c6ea4513217de96d44083b1c6198ef268faa92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/trees/31c6ea4513217de96d44083b1c6198ef268faa92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ng-galien/trust/git/commits/20a8e42158b7a82229783aab405908671990a987","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"