s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/commits/9927564d0a9568487ea204df938acbaa1dea3f85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T01:37:05Z","email":"maxtormez347@gmail.com","name":"GleipM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T01:37:05Z","email":"maxtormez347@gmail.com","name":"GleipM"},"message":"Corrige tsconfig del webshell y regenera lockfile obsoleto\n\n- apps/webshell/tsconfig.json (01) no incluia remotes.d.ts, por lo que\n  tsc --noEmit fallaba al no encontrar el modulo del remoto aunque el\n  build de Vite pasara.\n- package-lock.json (02) referenciaba el paquete renombrado\n  inventory-front en vez de pets-front; se regenero con npm install.\n- Se documentan ambos hallazgos en CORRECCIONES.md junto con los\n  resultados de la verificacion de build/typecheck.","tree":{"sha":"aa299051dead495e0ca86282a07adcf2d929dc87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/git/trees/aa299051dead495e0ca86282a07adcf2d929dc87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/git/commits/9927564d0a9568487ea204df938acbaa1dea3f85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115440210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/gis