-del-tesoro-parte-2/commit/6b5ef1bdafd4ce7a23bea3ae25958b2eb686d52d","node_id":"C_kwDOTShzBNoAKDZiNWVmMWJkYWZkNGNlN2EyM2JlYTNhZTI1OTU4YjJlYjY4NmQ1MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/commit/ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb","sha":"ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/commits/ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb"}],"sha":"6b5ef1bdafd4ce7a23bea3ae25958b2eb686d52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/commits/6b5ef1bdafd4ce7a23bea3ae25958b2eb686d52d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115440210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gleip347","id":115440210,"login":"Gleip347","node_id":"U_kgDOBuF6Ug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/commits/ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T01:24:06Z","email":"maxtormez347@gmail.com","name":"GleipM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T01:24:06Z","email":"maxtormez347@gmail.com","name":"GleipM"},"message":"Corrige incidentes de CRUD en ambos microfrontends (runtime y build-time)\n\nArregla typos y bugs de logica/UI que rompian crear, editar y eliminar\nmascotas: onChange mal escrito, id duplicado en el seed, borrado de la\nfila incorrecta, contraste del buscador, imports de Module Federation\ndesincronizados, validacion de edad absurda, metrica de tratamiento mal\nfiltrada y columna de acciones oculta.","tree":{"sha":"95f14312312e2cf3a55571af7430ec1168261030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/git/trees/95f14312312e2cf3a55571af7430ec1168261030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/git/commits/ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115440210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gleip347","id":115440210,"login":"Gleip347","node_id":"U_kgDOBuF6Ug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gleip347","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-parte-2/commit/ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb","node_id":"C_kwDOTShzBNoAKGNlMDgwZjcwMDg3NTU2OTUzYmEzMTY4ZTQ4ZWIwZjc3NjA5Nzk2Y2I","parents":[],"sha":"ce080f70087556953ba3168e48eb0f77609796cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GleipM/busqueda-del-tesoro-p