 Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcaf351af95762e94ebe40324f49eaaecf304b09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/git/trees/dcaf351af95762e94ebe40324f49eaaecf304b09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/git/commits/aadb86273e2b3401096dee82f6b861008df3a594","verification":{"payload":"tree dcaf351af95762e94ebe40324f49eaaecf304b09\nparent df32ce4a29c520bf499392e5aa15f63c2aea2725\nauthor Eileen Kang <eileen_kang@tech.gov.sg> 1783393445 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783393445 +0000\n\nfeat: export status to Excel (#41) (#88)\n\n* docs: add design spec for export status to Excel (#41)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: add implementation plan for export status to Excel (#41)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(export): add downloadXlsx helper with tests (#41)\n\n* feat(hooks): add useIsMobile hook with tests (#41)\n\n* feat(export): replace CSV with XLSX export, add mobile disabled state (#41)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(export): add RecipientReadTable integration tests (#41)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ui): use React Context in RadioGroup so nested RadioGroupItems work\n\nThe previous cloneElement approach only injected group state into direct\nchildren, breaking RadioGroupItem when wrapped in a label (as in\nRecipientFilterPopover''s RadioOption component).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: update text PG Status to Status\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTGy1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATJUQAKm5oo0B1r1EW/wiDgYnWy+H\ngKc1PVidSfRtaq0JPkQeJD77SBNgdCBh/ylLfSevvJyjmdOc1AQANPy/pcHstEqb\n2nprw3I/mztZv