d":7741667,"login":"kmye","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDE2Njc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmye/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmye/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmye/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmye/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmye","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/commits/1b13686326b95a68b440c7477c60c1b31faa9cf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:13:34Z","email":"eileen_kang@tech.gov.sg","name":"Eileen Kang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:13:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(api): API extraction design spec and implementation plan (#84)\n\n* docs(api): add API extraction design spec\n\nDefines the architecture for decoupling post API requests from frontend\nUI into a pure data-access layer with typed errors and no side effects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api): add API extraction implementation plan\n\n14-task TDD plan for decoupling post API requests from frontend UI\ninto a three-layer architecture (api/ → services/ → pages/).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(routes): implement production URL paths for all post types\n\nReplace prefixed ID route params with clean nested paths:\n- /posts/announcements/:id, /posts/consent-forms/:id (detail)\n- /posts/announcements/:id/edit, /posts/consent-forms/:id/edit (edit posted)\n- /posts/announcements/drafts/:id/edit, /posts/consent-forms/drafts/:id/edit (edit draft)\n\nUse factory pattern for loaders (makePostDetailLoader, makeCreatePostLoader)\nso each route closes over its postKind/draft context without needing\nReact Router context. Remove all branded type imports and prefixed-ID\nparsing from page components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(posts): remove dead loader export from CreatePostPage\n\nThe exported `loader = makeCreatePostLoader()` was unused — App.tsx calls\n`makeCreatePostLoader()` directly with explicit args for each route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): add RateLimitError class\n\n* feat(api): extract http.ts with pure error handling\n\nCreate src/features/posts/api/http.ts — fetch infrastructure extracted\nfrom client.ts with all UI side effects removed. handleErrorResponse\nthrows typed errors only (SessionExpiredError, RateLimitError, etc.)\nwith no window.location redirects or toast calls. handleRedirectResponse\nthrows RedirectError only. CSRF retry logic preserved at transport level.\nExports: fetchApi, fetchApiRoot, mutateApi, deleteApi, postMultipart,\nunwrapEnvelope. Add full test suite to http.test.ts covering error\nmapping, CSRF retry, timeout, and URL construction.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): extract announcements.ts domain module\n\n* feat(api): extract consent-forms.ts domain module\n\n* feat(api): extract school.ts domain module\n\n* feat(api): extract session.ts domain module\n\nExtracts fetchSession, fetchUserProfile, getConfigs (with TTL cache),\nupdateDisplayName, and updateDisplayEmail into a standalone module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): extract uploads.ts domain module\n\nExtracts validateAttachmentUpload, uploadToPresignedUrl,\nverifyAttachmentUpload, and isPresignedUrlTrusted into a standalone\nmodule with comprehensive tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): add barrel re-export index.ts\n\nExports all extracted domain modules (announcements, consent-forms,\nschool, session, uploads) plus errors and types from a single entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(api): remove unused imports from extraction tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(pages): rewire all imports from client.ts to domain modules\n\nPages, components, and the groups feature barrel now import directly\nfrom announcements.ts, consent-forms.ts, school.ts, session.ts, and\nuploads.ts. No production code imports from client.ts remain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pages): replace dynamic import from client.ts in PostDetailPage loader\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43ff399aeeb26a330ccf3d6dd5e80180a12f3edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/git/trees/43ff399aeeb26a330ccf3d6dd5e80180a12f3edd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/git/commits/1b13686326b95a68b440c7477c60c1b31faa9cf9","verification":{"payload":"tree 43ff399aeeb26a330ccf3d6dd5e80180a12f3edd\nparent daddccc1f6a5c3db961465f2bad97247f6b91f99\nauthor Eileen Kang <eileen_kang@tech.gov.sg> 1783318414 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783318414 +0000\n\ndocs(api): API extraction design spec and implementation plan (#84)\n\n* docs(api): add API extraction design spec\n\nDefines the architecture for decoupling post API requests from frontend\nUI into a pure data-access layer with typed errors and no side effects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api): add API extraction implementation plan\n\n14-task TDD plan for decoupling post API requests from frontend UI\ninto a three-layer architecture (api/ → services/ → pages/).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(routes): implement production 