rs (makePostDetailLoader, makeCreatePostLoader)\nso each route closes over its postKind/draft context without needing\nReact Router context. Remove all branded type imports and prefixed-ID\nparsing from page components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(posts): remove dead loader export from CreatePostPage\n\nThe exported `loader = makeCreatePostLoader()` was unused — App.tsx calls\n`makeCreatePostLoader()` directly with explicit args for each route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api): add production URL paths plan/spec, update client helpers\n\nAdd design spec and implementation plan for the production URL paths\nrefactor. Update API client to use the new explicit path helpers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12fe7413679f6fee3b4ac74b88e7ec10ff92badb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/git/trees/12fe7413679f6fee3b4ac74b88e7ec10ff92badb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gracestl/teacher-workspace-pg-frontend/git/commits/daddccc1f6a5c3db961465f2bad97247f6b91f99","verification":{"payload":"tree 12fe7413679f6fee3b4ac74b88e7ec10ff92badb\nparent 1e9f3fd8822b09bdbe60717039029974ec40f009\nauthor Eileen Kang <eileen_kang@tech.gov.sg> 1783305987 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783305987 +0000\n\nchore: refactor urls (#86)\n\n* refactor(posts): remove branded ID types, add numericId and clean postHref\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(api): accept bare numeric IDs instead of branded strings\n\nRemove AnnouncementId, AnnouncementDraftId, ConsentFormId, ConsentFormDraftId\nbranded type imports and prefix-stripping logic; update all function signatures\nto accept plain number parameters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(routes): implement production URL paths for all post types\n\nReplace prefixed ID route params with clean nested paths:\n- /posts/announcements/:id, /posts/consent-forms/:id (detail)\n- /posts/announcements/:id/edit, /posts/consent-forms/:id/edit (edit posted)\n- /posts/announcements/drafts/:id/edit, /posts/consent-forms/drafts/:id/edit (edit draft)\n\nUse factory pattern for loaders (makePostDetailLoader, makeCreatePostLoader)\nso each route closes over its postKind/draft context without needing\nReact Router context. Remove all branded type imports and prefixed-ID\nparsing from page components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(posts): remove dead loader export from CreatePostPage\n\nThe exported `loader = makeCreatePostLoader()` was unused — App.tsx calls\n`makeCreatePostLoader()` directly with explicit args for each route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api): add production URL paths plan/spec, update client helpers\n\nAdd design spec and implementation plan for the production URL paths\nrefactor. Update API client to use the new explicit path helpers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSxcTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjtYQAGO31f1dIeltsshv3TlE5kA2\nRh0bzIxF93dQNuJpz67oiMnAMYXSYN43XG3xXeqkElUK/jGeHv5OzzpFtTPNKPTF\nP/LZShmeuQonN11KXtbQ8pdILKV+WhThtWnC9SpXKox9SfmPp8iZBaTlb6SKR/hc\nkrH9mSclnQ1nWYjb9RlPVQgR6zXQ7JgTgH9sRx3jNnuZloWje1fo0UTZo4ygqpf3\nIInbCM6kQOxBdhWdHReTJFXFGEZEcCgC4Zj5r1qBWlXDNanGbhnjF2U/SVG86FxI\ndylGsz8wnph2BHhXwppVIqD7qDkTru9dLbB9S0R2ufn2gMyAsWRcSJc279lNqem/\njw3OMWyXmA39KVOwxpU1cuxxyNfX0ugLNS1YU5z45hgysQ4LmbyKbIiXVzY0jS7X\ntkEISDHs1MlRgNZUP+GO5S2ED/wCsRxyfAOKIWRXR6HjBN5NIrNx7ByX4I+AeaOp\naTOK7elBdi7bzYJglRP+1OpjC8SEltuRGmagfxka5lrQ0lrDRmhkhzkoJYYKKVkV\nDOD3W5lEL+OQCtkUICFc55nxfsNoQGPcH9IpozZ99JYqYDh