users/Waleed-Mujahid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Waleed-Mujahid","id":81019006,"login":"Waleed-Mujahid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDE5MDA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Waleed-Mujahid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/432e02cae358e5fae7c2310e776f5425f101083a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:05:23Z","email":"81019006+Waleed-Mujahid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Muhammad Waleed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T13:05:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: wrap award_course_certificate.delay in transaction.on_commit (#38774)\n\nCOURSE_CERT_CHANGED fires synchronously during GeneratedCertificate.save(),\nwhich runs inside the generate_certificate Celery task. The .delay() call\nwas enqueuing award_course_certificate before the DB transaction committed,\nso the task raced ahead and hit eligible_certificates.get() DoesNotExist —\nexiting silently with no retry, and never posting the course cert to\nCredentials.\n\nWrapping in transaction.on_commit() guarantees the cert row is committed\nbefore the task is enqueued.\n\nFixes: EDLYPRODUCT-5411","tree":{"sha":"421f9fe9108a3c645fb37854412867cec4ae937f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/421f9fe9108a3c645fb37854412867cec4ae937f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/432e02cae358e5fae7c2310e776f5425f101083a","verification":{"payload":"tree 421f9fe9108a3c645fb37854412867cec4ae937f\nparent 36a192d980faada26a423905f2a64c471928761b\nauthor Muhammad Waleed <81019006+Waleed-Mujahid@users.noreply.github.com> 1782306323 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782306323 +0500\n\nfix: wrap award_course_certificate.delay in transaction.on_commit (#38774)\n\nCOURSE_CERT_CHANGED fires synchronously during GeneratedCertificate.save(),\nwhich runs inside the generate_certificate Celery task. The .delay() call\nwas enqueuing award_course_certificate before the DB transaction committed,\nso the task raced ahead and hit eligible_certificates.get() DoesNotExist —\nexiting silently with no retry, and never posting the course cert to\nCredentials.\n\nWrapping in transaction.on_commit() guarantees the cert row is committed\nbefore the task is enqueued.\n\nFixes: EDLYPRODUCT-5411","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqO9YTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuwwQAHexyeQg8Scy3PISsE4uFnp+\nWWYIYXvqDS0nw62I7pQAHYRKOZENClnehX8cfdPdCKMtIydDoZRqXGIePppesUHX\neNaW1lsdVyVpB5gheQDsQDR1T34/mPaJFrSqnv4L+82Y7TvTxoi4ywP+eDVtFFhp\nKsQwbYMNJQ//PckBRamcnqPfM9FUp0xsCb0sjuSDItJOqJsYs0V0visS+Npr6Kmv\n3rm1XvpwfdLnqMjZ8T0N2r95DMDTcCBcLiunmix1G1/VXYBDxjpqiv2sEdVQHk1H\n+K4wBfyILdick33V1adv9t2Kvn6UiMNVVJLfk/vdwYnN+u/n4+J9TT7x+UK7QdsE\nyV0WhGJPbQlOaSFGt1fsR6AFPVJhO7d9meteUCrnjknQxWa1cgyt4T4L8X/1Ijfx\ntdy8a3cZiP4h8ErQ3KCcyHRxddxco8rxa3J2cbcKSvdW92Pz+6pKV2gC4RFll7bf\nwXVH8vg0SZdYDqBlDFKVd5Q80jvAUsmW+0jIiMoNQGTrYtWbG32o07ulklhn17Ym\nNugGbOjZsUlVtHRgVd3L4C6Ee+aVl4SOL90ETrc8F/AtgCg7UoMW+vq9uMwZVRQj\nMhlD39DrgxHE25OE/HVQjaq3wyj2fx68EATHznRPMw1sV7mDltCqNokVa2P6BLCJ\nQvplekEsVRCa/PYemNxk\n=58bj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T05:53:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.