 [DEPR]\n\nRemoves the HomePageCourses API v1 endpoint (GET /api/contentstore/v1/home/courses)\nas it has been superseded by v2 since the Sumac release and is no longer used\nby the Authoring MFE.\n\nRemoves:\n- HomePageCoursesView and its URL from contentstore v1\n- CourseHomeTabSerializer (only used by the removed view)\n- All associated tests (HomePageCoursesViewTest)\n- Unused imports (get_course_context, CourseHomeTabSerializer)\n\nCloses: https://github.com/openedx/public-engineering/issues/287\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c9595ef8e965da83834d639c0ba847be9c7e780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/1c9595ef8e965da83834d639c0ba847be9c7e780"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/33b3480b7269417285b6d796ab5cc47339edccc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/33b3480b7269417285b6d796ab5cc47339edccc5","node_id":"C_kwDOTSs9wNoAKDMzYjM0ODBiNzI2OTQxNzI4NWI2ZDc5NmFiNWNjNDczMzllZGNjYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/7c68590e42f7f87d3e576b616f290c6ed694f8f2","sha":"7c68590e42f7f87d3e576b616f290c6ed694f8f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/7c68590e42f7f87d3e576b616f290c6ed694f8f2"}],"sha":"33b3480b7269417285b6d796ab5cc47339edccc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/33b3480b7269417285b6d796ab5cc47339edccc5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/945577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith