/api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/18d1c679e685054692018daf05856475cc63eee0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T18:47:58Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:21:36Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"chore: pin openedx-authz to 1.16.0\n\nopenedx-authz 1.18.0 added validation that rejects the bare global\nscope wildcard ''*''. content_libraries calls authz_api.is_user_allowed\nwith that wildcard from user_can_create_library, so the upgrade broke\nLibraryRestoreViewTestCase::test_restore_library_unauthorized (and\nlikely other code paths exercised at runtime).\n\nRoll openedx-authz back to 1.16.0 until the team owning the\nauthz migration lands the call-site updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74f443d429695b7444c967559617aeb11de1bfd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/74f443d429695b7444c967559617aeb11de1bfd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/18d1c679e685054692018daf05856475cc63eee0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/18d1c679e685054692018daf05856475cc63eee0","node_id":"C_kwDOTSs9wNoAKDE4ZDFjNjc5ZTY4NTA1NDY5MjAxOGRhZjA1ODU2NDc1Y2M2M2VlZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629","sha":"f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629"}],"sha":"18d1c679e685054692018daf05856475cc63eee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/18d1c679e685054692018daf05856475cc63eee0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T17:56:20Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:21:36Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"fix!: emit empty cells for unset city/country in student profile CSV\n\nBefore this change, the Student Profile Information CSV that\ninstructors download from the instructor dashboard showed the literal\ntext \"None\" in the city column for users who had not set a city. The\ncountry column for the same users showed up as an empty cell instead.\n\nThe cause was a quirk in how the report extracted values: any field\nwhose Python value was None ended up stringified to \"None\", but\ncountry was a special object that stringified to \"\" instead. A 2016\ncode comment flagged this as \"somewhat inconsistent\" but it was never\nfixed.\n\nThe django-countries 9.0.0 upgrade removes the country special case:\nan unset country is now plain None, just like city. That made the\ncountry column also show \"None\", which broke the test that documented\nthe old quirk.\n\nRather than accept \"None\" cells in two columns, this commit fixes the\nunderlying behaviour so any unset field shows as an empty cell.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: In the Student Profile Information CSV report, cells\nfor unset fields (city, country, language, mailing address, etc.)\nthat used to read the literal text \"None\" are now empty cells.\nCountry cells that used to be empty stay empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59c127cc7edf4eb03e3c6114c70145609783cacc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/59c127cc7edf4eb03e3c6114c70145609783cacc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629","node_id":"C_kwDOTSs9wNoAKGYxNzc3ZGQzOGI0NzFjMWM2ZmNiNjVjMzE0OGQ2ZTljNDQzMjY2Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8","sha":"d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8"}],"sha":"f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/f1777dd38b471c1c6fcb65c3148d6e9c44326629"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T15:59:39Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:21:36Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"fix: stabilize and tighten VideoVolumeControl render spec\n\nThe ''render the volume control'' spec asserted only that *some* element\nwith class `.volume` existed in the global DOM. It never referenced the\n`volumeControl` instance set up in `beforeEach`, so it would pass as\nlong as any `.volume`-classed element was rendered anywhere — and it ran\nsynchronously, so it didn''t tolerate the rendering completing on a later\ntick.\n\nWait for VideoVolumeControl''s own element to attach to its\n`.secondary-controls` parent using the `jasmine.waitUntil` pattern\nalready established in neighboring specs (video_poster_spec.js,\nvideo_progress_slider_spec.js), then assert the element is in the DOM.\nAdd an explicit `.fail()` branch so the next timeout produces an\nactionable error instead of a generic Jasmine timeout.","tree":{"sha":"758877e5af7faacd88794678a7fd6e617262514d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/758877e5af7faacd88794678a7fd6e617262514d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8","node_id":"C_kwDOTSs9wNoAKGQyYTRkMDhkMzQ5MTU4OTY3ZWQwMjBjYTZhZjg5MzA1Zjg2NGUxZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commit/8d27a5960307e8ff3f3090ccd55315968a23ef2e","sha":"8d27a5960307e8ff3f3090ccd55315968a23ef2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/8d27a5960307e8ff3f3090ccd55315968a23ef2e"}],"sha":"d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/d2a4d08d349158967ed020ca6af89305f864e1f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/8d27a5960307e8ff3f3090ccd55315968a23ef2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T15:43:44Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:21:36Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"fix: handle None UserProfile.country after django-countries 9.0.0\n\ndjango-countries 9.0.0 changed nullable CountryField semantics: a NULL\ndatabase value now returns None instead of Country(code=None). Update\nall UserProfile.country call sites that previously relied on the old\nbehavior:\n\n- Replace `country.code is None` checks with `country is None`\n  (embargo/api.py, credit/api/provider.py).\n- Guard `.code`/`.name` attribute accesses against None\n  (credit/tests/factories.py, user_api/accounts/serializers.py,\n  courseware/views/views.py).\n- Emit \"\" instead of str(None) == \"None\" for Segment traits when\n  country is null (student/models/user.py, user_authn/views/register.py)\n  to preserve existing serialized output and matching test assertions.\n\nRelease notes: https://github.com/SmileyChris/django-countries/blob/main/CHANGES.rst#900-10-june-2026\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f27857447c833b482bdb269dff33d23f32c0f11e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/f27857447c833b482bdb269dff33d23f32c0f11e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/8d27a5960307e8ff3f3090ccd55315968a23ef2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil","user_view_t