ntent library events (#38508)\n\n* fix: update modulestore migrator to not publish in draft context\n* fix: use correct date/user info for modulestore migrator\n* fix: allow our event handling tasks to call subtasks\n* fix: better handling of deletion/un-deletion using openedx-core fixes\n* fix: exception raised when mass-deleting all items in a content library\n  (ContentLibraryBlockNotFound was being raised and not caught, propagating up to celery task error)\n* fix: don''t update the ''collections'' field of deleted entities when modifying a collection\n* fix: keep collection \"# of entities\" count updated when entities deleted\n* refactor: use LIBRARY_COLLECTION_UPDATED event to update collections on entity (un)delete\n* fix: unable to delete \"ghost\" component in library if it exists but has no draft\n* chore: bump openedx-core version to 1.1.0\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fdf030bbda1361bab49b79738a1cccb3dfbc09b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/9fdf030bbda1361bab49b79738a1cccb3dfbc09b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/c38864ac2ab71978d1d8940ab91661ed49d7328d","verification":{"payload":"tree 9fdf030bbda1361bab49b79738a1cccb3dfbc09b\nparent 8e89256ddbaadb2a7c5d9fefb959fcbf215c0e6c\nauthor Braden MacDonald <braden@opencraft.com> 1780392125 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780392125 +0000\n\nfix: various issues with modulestore migrator and content library events (#38508)\n\n* fix: update modulestore migrator to not publish in draft context\n* fix: use correct date/user info for modulestore migrator\n* fix: allow our event handling tasks to call subtasks\n* fix: better handling of deletion/un-deletion using openedx-core fixes\n* fix: exception raised when mass-deleting all items in a content library\n  (ContentLibraryBlockNotFound was being raised and not caught, propagating up to celery task error)\n* fix: don''t update the ''collections'' field of deleted entities when modifying a collection\n* fix: keep collection \"# of entities\" count updated when entities deleted\n* refactor: use LIBRARY_COLLECTION_UPDATED event to update collections on entity (un)delete\n* fix: unable to delete \"ghost\" component in library if it exists but has no draft\n* chore: bump openedx-core version to 1.1.0\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHqC9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8ZwQAG/LkkxgLvkO5lvgGkDbjwls\ncYWzumOfGWn9ifhADizi+IGnapiYwyLYinC002neoKTz7rruICKb1eoexoQqQld2\nFntW1HDWh+6oKUX99nLnoqjYGbrmdHutR/h0r0qh06mRc7T3xJXklp1IQKsNTYs1\nc/fDJGIelYG6w4GPRLxhuhomMTvPj+IeWUSv8/7Dm9WV3N9ln9ZdszCE0O8uWxzw\nNudHgaJdltn+/PSbu5t/r+RmquxJhemcDzfGQPSxurQNUo+CKPojhgaLP2v1LdPe\nJF0kQtjG1wvSNNOhPlnz8c7uaQpXRrRPSI1et9uHQ8AVQbfslHKfe2fHRps9RrXV\nahmlTZ7lIyS/+3O49BPBjBJEMnbEHevhqYOfdP75C58KtrGZaMAU6sCBy8AxioyL\nE2ke+pTm2xN54GPG7zOp6Bw1BcskVlyDDBb+CmzPDGzbKLS3sufNUlO48nRJ61FR\nR8wgWT/l+N8gxQ+ILAgj2uViZpqtxpJibnGbT2s6ReYeeUJYQRSekJX2+mJtY/b8\nXVtVc66K3EXjueMmK4iTGvAmyiAkKURrO6gqqXx4Tm6YZDi6VSUG/KrHSRWmzFnh\nTaIp9On0Mhg7EwtWoEE9QIlgzbx3mqzE57gUeGL2uu4DR0oZIXhy4+pUbcHVvDO0\ndxxBBlGysUdpJpqgwBjY\n=Oxbg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T05:53:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_