s://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktyagiapphelix2u","id":211787082,"login":"ktyagiapphelix2u","node_id":"U_kgDODJ-dSg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktyagiapphelix2u","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/82b77ae711780fedbb37994feea3bbbd39405a97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T14:48:20Z","email":"ktyagi-apphelix@2u.com","name":"Krish Tyagi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T14:48:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: redact PII fields before delete in user retirement flows (#38426)\n\nAdds support for redacting sensitive PII fields before deletion\nin DeletableByUserValue models. This is useful when there is a\ndownstream sync of data that retains soft-deleted records, so\nthe data will be redacted for user retirements.\n\nChanges include:\n- Add redact_before_delete_fields hook to model mixin\n- Redact emails before delete for:\n  - CourseEnrollmentAllowed\n  - PendingEmailChange\n  - UnregisteredLearnerCohortAssignments\n- Adds SQL assertion helpers to verify UPDATE occurs before DELETE\n- Adds regression/unit tests for safe ID-filtered redaction and deletion flows\n- Updates email change flow to use delete_by_user_value, to pick up the\n  redact functionality.","tree":{"sha":"9f21ff1c6d4191c569453ddf6287f08f781aa6b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/9f21ff1c6d4191c569453ddf6287f08f781aa6b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/82b77ae711780fedbb37994feea3bbbd39405a97","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f21ff1c6d4191c569453ddf6287f08f781aa6b3\nparent 59bb6d669e4fdc24d96afb809e12119372d9e257\nauthor Krish Tyagi <ktyagi-apphelix@2u.com> 1780325300 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780325300 +0000\n\nfeat: redact PII fields before delete in user retirement flows (#38426)\n\nAdds support for redacting sensitive PII fields before deletion\nin DeletableByUserValue models. This is useful when there is a\ndownstream sync of data that retains soft-deleted records, so\nthe data will be redacted for user retirements.\n\nChanges include:\n- Add redact_before_delete_fields hook to model mixin\n- Redact emails before delete for:\n  - CourseEnrollmentAllowed\n  - PendingEmailChange\n  - UnregisteredLearnerCohortAssignments\n- Adds SQL assertion helpers to verify UPDATE occurs before DELETE\n- Adds regression/unit tests for safe ID-filtered redaction and deletion flows\n- Updates email change flow to use delete_by_user_value, to pick up the\n  redact functionality.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHZu0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADT4QACElMnxBVCmu+EuRHx1OTF07\nhsLM/sBUfJOannl0kw+UTAZYFRQfdjmawhHXyFxGq0ioLdaa7YmsfvUMszvpV5M+\niBje5w7c/DoOHNuaOMJxw3lqUtXiviuW6JR+k3NDVc1JeR3SLYd/Ml3uMe0wasfE\nrwxWSHqNdHN5UyrjDMDxrRsv+weUFPVRsYXVfZijq36dFkFj8OGvJjgZ0s2gWzwf\nKI3ny7liv2YK66F2y/6QZ6iZty5+oHjymGUmgT4Pg4hSifXignKDd/zE2S7QH3nZ\n1/KqbsB3H9DFMvJWVF+cGMwEn6f29u9DDRklGG/SPypbAcQP9BGaXPBFIvCcgF4n\n1e/E8Mmg66KHkxNelfAC7z+7banskw9M9Bqk0S17FQdRZWmqyrLdssRZ/rLNgEQh\nSZO0SsNWGnJW0cSKO1JtY8eEVVtjR+uaTJ627yRWip8yBj0Fkdpn1wg9d2UK3R/q\nC7hl1xmj+iXOpp4UwpdaWoyoAHPVcOc6HE9jzCsrGexSpw8mA0uUPsCVm6duLU2l\nqWp/ccYv2zsKbPI+XJQmimWY6HySsPWGhzKs9swqiR/SXXKwq1JhhEDQnIRYlVwm\nzBl514qRzS6CStVXu/tCN+5zbL5ZSytMwUXeOhUFUNz4WviiYTV09/vDt2cj7VbO\nRi6Tbfye+9PpjMLsPlKE\n=Pubk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified