/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/commits/bc589aa6db5c395ab4c0c1d7ed016436e32d472e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T07:11:57Z","email":"iahmad@2u.com","name":"irfanuddinahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T02:12:31Z","email":"iahmad@2u.com","name":"irfanuddinahmad"},"message":"feat!: General cleanup of legacy Studio page waffle flags and related code.\n\nRemove the waffle flags and helper functions for all legacy Studio pages\nthat have been replaced by the Authoring MFE:\n- legacy_studio.schedule_details\n- legacy_studio.advanced_settings\n- legacy_studio.grading\n- legacy_studio.import\n- legacy_studio.export\n- legacy_studio.course_team\n- legacy_studio.certificates\n- legacy_studio.configurations\n\nAlso removes the course_waffle_flags REST API endpoint\n(GET /api/contentstore/v1/course_waffle_flags) and its serializer, view,\nand tests, as these only existed to expose the now-removed flags.\n\nSimplifies URL helpers in utils.py to unconditionally return MFE URLs.\n\nThis work is part of https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36108\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: All of the above waffle flags are removed. The\nGET /api/contentstore/v1/course_waffle_flags endpoint is removed.","tree":{"sha":"44ecbd05b3f3efab4f842339114e664d03af5910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/trees/44ecbd05b3f3efab4f842339114e664d03af5910"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranivakhare-hub/Edx-Platform-ULMO/git/commits/bc589aa6db5c395ab4c0c1d7ed016436e32d472e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34648393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irfanuddinahmad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irfanuddinahmad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irfanuddinahmad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user