 as the original) is\nregistered in the shared @plone/registry under the key\n\"blicca.SelectedItem\" and activated site-wide via the\ncomponentRegistryKeys.selectedItem pattern option in\nplone.patternoptions — the content browser selection now renders with\nthe Blicca component.\n\nHost and add-on share one Svelte runtime via module federation: the\nadd-on declares the same \"svelte\" and \"svelte/\" singleton shares as\nMockup (5.7 or later) in its webpack config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4df56a87097a1d7498e0892c814aedd3b986c436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/4df56a87097a1d7498e0892c814aedd3b986c436"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/8f1948a51de25b971c436cdacd0da591a39d5a91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commit/8f1948a51de25b971c436cda