xMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/f5009cdcc7a1a34ec4f58505876361526a8e329d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:27:39Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:27:39Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Step 4 — Overriding a Svelte component\n\nOur own SelectedItem.svelte (same props interface as the original) is\nregistered in the shared @plone/registry under the key\n\"blicca.SelectedItem\" and activated site-wide via the\ncomponentRegistryKeys.selectedItem pattern option in\nplone.patternoptions — the content browser selection now renders with\nthe Blicca component.\n\nHost and add-on share one Svelte runtime via module federation: the\nadd-on declares the same \"svelte\" and \"svelte/\" singleton shares as\nMockup (5.7 or later) in its webpack config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14a95d029505e7174aac9b2b491dc0cdcd85bfc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/14a95d029505e7174aac9b2b491dc0cdcd85bfc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/f5009cdcc7a1a34ec4f58505876361526a8e329d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://a