"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/6e45f3c14572479505fc2cb739680d8b2008e32d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:27:36Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:27:36Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Step 1 — Overrides without JavaScript\n\nPython package skeleton with GenericSetup profiles, the\n++plone++blicca.staticresourceoverride static directory and a first\noverride that needs no build at all: external links open in a new\nwindow, configured site-wide via the plone.patternoptions registry\nrecord (rendered as data-pat-markspeciallinks on the <body>).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a16b7b55c16f15b4860cd37df9ece892edf4a675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/a16b7b55c16f15b4860cd37df9ece892edf4a675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/6e45f3c14572479505fc2cb739680d8b2008e32d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","r