":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Update the setup instructions for Cookieplone 2.0\n\nCookieplone 2.0 dropped the classic_project template. The setup now\nuses the prerequisites from the Plone documentation, generates the\nproject with \"uvx cookieplone project\" and answers \"Use Volto as\nfrontend?\" with No. The generated backend is managed by uv: the add-on\ngoes into backend/mx.ini plus the dependencies in backend/pyproject.toml,\nand plone.staticresources is pinned to a release with Mockup 5.6.11 via\nmxdev version-overrides. Verified with a generated project and a full\nmake install.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4993e4c513fee1a982a37883a2d4f95da4773f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/4993e4c513fee1a982a37883a2d4f95da4773f28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/179c01e9210ed1eae16cfff79fe704409cde1adc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_