sters its\npatterns, and our replacement extends the original class under an own\nname with the original trigger, bridging the original''s options via\nmockupParser.getOptions(). External links now get a different icon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce70f33f8cbf0945ecff66ebc462404bc03a9271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/ce70f33f8cbf0945ecff66ebc462404bc03a9271"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/bd1cdb9c5659f8464cc9595a351e9fd4551af259","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commit/bd1cdb9c5659f8464cc9595a351e9fd4551af259","node_id":"C_kwDOTSx1j9oAKGJkMWNkYjljNTY1OWY4NDY0Y2M5NTk1YTM1MWU5ZmQ0NTUxYWYyNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commit/80615696702a671ed9b475ca681929736ee17613","sha":"80615696702a