0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:53:40Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Explain the bundle ordering of the blacklist preload\n\nThe depends field only knows \"after\": empty means as early as\npossible, \"*\" means after all other bundles — so depends=\"*\" would be\nthe wrong choice for the preload. Bundles without dependencies render\nin alphabetical order of their record names, and the blacklist takes\neffect at registration time anyway, before Mockup''s async chunk runs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"074aefb1b47ff1aa4a0222fa52a0cb75e474415e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/074aefb1b47ff1aa4a0222fa52a0cb75e474415e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/3e7692ccf99a5ede581905b82cfb09f9c6dd7563","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.stat