lte (same props interface as the original) is\nregistered in the shared @plone/registry under the key\n\"blicca.SelectedItem\" and activated site-wide via the\ncomponentRegistryKeys.selectedItem pattern option in\nplone.patternoptions — the content browser selection now renders with\nthe Blicca component.\n\nHost and add-on share one Svelte runtime via module federation: the\nadd-on declares the same \"svelte\" and \"svelte/\" singleton shares as\nMockup (5.7 or later) in its webpack config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68092a7a136c0ef73f848f74a201719464849877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/68092a7a136c0ef73f848f74a201719464849877"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/caa2dd1949835d48f1506127d2450385c8290fd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commit/caa2dd1949835d48f1506127d2450385c8290fd4","node_id":"C_kwDOTSx1j9oAKGNhYTJkZDE5NDk4MzVkNDhmMTUwNjEyN2QyNDUwMzg1YzgyOTBmZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commit/4abf09b16c7eedf419cadca4c9bef6d8756fd508","sha":"4abf09b16c7eedf419cadca4c9bef6d8756fd508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/4abf09b16c7eedf419cadca4c9bef6d8756fd508"}],"sha":"caa2dd1949835d48f1506127d2450385c8290fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/caa2dd1949835d48f1506127d2450385c8290fd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/4abf09b16c7eedf419cadca4c9bef6d8756fd508/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T06:25:58Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:27:50Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Step 3 — Replacing a core pattern\n\nThe markspeciallinks pattern is replaced: a tiny unbuilt preload bundle\nsets the Patternslib pattern blacklist before Mockup registers its\npatterns, and our replacement extends the original class under an own\nname with the original trigger, bridging the original''s options via\nmockupParser.getOptions(). External links now get a different icon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d81925eb0af1244f642f0fd0bd4500cbfe5868a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/6d81925eb0af1244f642f0fd0bd4500cbfe5868a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/4abf09b16c7eedf419cadca4c9bef6d8756fd508","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commit/4abf09b16c7eedf419cadca4c9bef6d8756fd508","node_id":"C_kwDOTSx1j9oAKDRhYmYwOWIxNmM3ZWVkZjQxOWNhZGNhNGM5YmVmNmQ4NzU2ZmQ1MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/collec