,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/7f52ade7405dd53ecba2e4f252b876b15a114bc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T06:25:58Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:12:09Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Step 4 — Overriding a Svelte component\n\nOur own SelectedItem.svelte (same props interface as the original) is\nregistered in the shared @plone/registry under the key\n\"blicca.SelectedItem\" and activated site-wide via the\ncomponentRegistryKeys.selectedItem pattern option in\nplone.patternoptions — the content browser selection now renders with\nthe Blicca component.\n\nHost and add-on share one Svelte runtime via module federation: the\nadd-on declares the same \"svelte\" and \"svelte/\" singleton shares as\nMockup (5.7 or later) in its webpack config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"553059b30c1eb03b7cb2abb64bb5f93a23443510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/553059b30c1eb03b7cb2abb64bb5f93a23443510"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/7f52ade7405dd53ecba2e4f252b876b15a114bc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com