}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/commits/f33e690a80e250160a8315b565ef6f88a3f0712a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T06:25:58Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:12:09Z","email":"peter.mathis@kombinat.at","name":"Peter Mathis"},"message":"Step 3 — Replacing a core pattern\n\nThe markspeciallinks pattern is replaced: a tiny unbuilt preload bundle\nsets the Patternslib pattern blacklist before Mockup registers its\npatterns, and our replacement extends the original class under an own\nname with the original trigger, bridging the original''s options via\nmockupParser.getOptions(). External links now get a different icon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38758fed2d8effc065e3434a3028ec10a21da570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/trees/38758fed2d8effc065e3434a3028ec10a21da570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/collective/blicca.staticresourceoverride/git/commits/f33e690a80e250160a8315b565ef6f88a3f0712a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/511761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petschki","id":511761,"login":"petschki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petschki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api