er/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisdaudier","id":1878216,"login":"chrisdaudier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzgyMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisdaudier/boulevard/commits/5d7c2e9c317c96111f0075b87afa29183a612942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T01:04:21Z","email":"chris.daudier@gmail.com","name":"Chris Daudier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T01:04:21Z","email":"chris.daudier@gmail.com","name":"Chris Daudier"},"message":"Add L2 distribution to Solace, Watchlist/OMS Order Entry MFEs, and OpenFin/HERE Core FDC3 interop\n\n- Rewrote OrderBook to flat-array zero-allocation storage (open-addressing hash table + sorted price-level arrays), verified via new benchmark project\n- Added ITCH message types the pipeline was silently dropping: Order Delete, Order Replace, Order Executed With Price, Add Order (MPID), Cross Trade, and Stock Directory for ticker resolution - root-caused several classes of phantom crossed-book state to these gaps\n- Fixed a lock-scope bug in Edge.MarketData where JSON serialization/socket I/O for L2 publishing held the book lock, starving the worker thread under sustained load; enlarged the datagram queue and socket receive buffer to absorb replay bursts\n- Reset OrderBook state on publisher loop/session restart instead of replaying stale order lifecycles into an already-advanced book\n- Added Boulevard.Edge.SolaceGateway (UDP L2 snapshot to MQTT bridge) and multi-file/--minutes chaining in the Nasdaq publisher for longer continuous replays\n- Added two React MFEs: watchlist-mfe (BBO watchlist, per-ticker Solace subscriptions) and oms-order-entry (single-ticker L2 depth plus mock order ticket), both wired to FDC3 (@finos/fdc3) for cross-app ticker context via getAgent and user channels\n- Added OpenFin/HERE Core Platform manifest and FDC3 App Directory under frontend/interop/, with a locally-trusted mkcert HTTPS setup (fins:// requires HTTPS and rejects self-signed certs) and fdc3InteropApi enabled so window.fdc3 is actually injected\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd3ff94c287fbd58eaaf3226ca21bdfb3e5b53ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisdaudier/boulevard/git/trees/fd3ff94c287fbd58eaaf3226ca21bdfb3e5b53ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisdaudier/boulevard/git/commits/5d7c2e9c317c96111f0075b87afa29183a612942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1878216?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisdaudier","id":1878216,"login":"chrisdaudier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzgyMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisdaudier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api