65ec966ba35509f4c3b","node_id":"C_kwDOTTIIINoAKDU0YzBhNTRhODRlNTQ0ODk5NDRkODY1ZWM5NjZiYTM1NTA5ZjRjM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a","sha":"2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a"}],"sha":"54c0a54a84e54489944d865ec966ba35509f4c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/54c0a54a84e54489944d865ec966ba35509f4c3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:18:24Z","email":"brahimvall.boumouzouna@etu.fstm.ac.ma","name":"Brahim Vall Boumouzouna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:45:06Z","email":"92952971+BoumouzounaBrahimVall@users.noreply.github.com","name":"BOUMOUZOUNA BRAHIM VALL"},"message":"fix(release): ship src so the published sourcemaps resolve\n\nCloses #37.\n\nAll three packages shipped .js.map and .d.ts.map but not the src/ they point\nat, so every map''s `sources` entry resolved to a path absent from the tarball.\nStack traces through OpenMini did not map back and \"go to definition\" on a\n.d.ts symbol landed nowhere — we paid ~35-39% of the runtime/cli unpacked size\nin maps and got nothing for it.\n\nAdd `src` to `files`, minus the tests. The exclusion mirrors each package''s\ntsconfig `exclude` exactly (`src/**/*.test.ts`), so what the compiler leaves\nout of dist is what the tarball leaves out — no test file ships, and no map\nreferences one.\n\nNo new public API surface: all three packages have a closed `exports` map, so\ndeep imports stay blocked whatever the tarball holds. Verified by installing\nthe packed tarball into a scratch consumer:\n\n  @openmini/runtime               -> resolves\n  @openmini/runtime/src/index.ts  -> ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED\n  @openmini/runtime/dist/index.js -> ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED\n\nVerified every map in every tarball now resolves — 120 `sources` entries\nchecked across the three packages, 0 unresolved, 0 test files shipped.\n\nPacked size cost: runtime 16.1 -> 19.3 kB, cli 36.9 -> 48.8 kB,\nreact-native 167.2 -> 180.4 kB.","tree":{"sha":"eae0dfc7e9a1f177d8e00dcd242fd0a32f7dd90d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/trees/eae0dfc7e9a1f177d8e00dcd242fd0a32f7dd90d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/commits/2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a","node_id":"C_kwDOTTIIINoAKDJiNzI0YjU4MDc1ZDE4NWEyN2FjMWM3MmI3ZmQwMDczN2M1Zjg0OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da","sha":"6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da"}],"sha":"2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/2b724b58075d185a27ac1c72b7fd00737c5f849a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:01:55Z","email":"brahimvall.boumouzouna@etu.fstm.ac.ma","name":"Brahim Vall Boumouzouna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:08:14Z","email":"92952971+BoumouzounaBrahimVall@users.noreply.github.com","name":"BOUMOUZOUNA BRAHIM VALL"},"message":"fix(deps): pin fast-xml-parser 5.7.0 in playground/spike for GHSA-gh4j-gqv2-49f6\n\nDependabot alerts #7 and #13 (medium): fast-xml-parser < 5.7.0 lets XMLBuilder\nemit unescaped comment/CDATA delimiters, allowing XML injection.\n\nThe vulnerable copy is fast-xml-parser@4.5.7, pulled in transitively by\n@react-native-community/cli-config-android and cli-platform-apple (both\n`^4.4.1`). There is no 4.x backport — 5.7.0 is the only patched release — so\nan override is the only route.\n\nBoth consumers use XMLParser and XMLValidator only, never XMLBuilder, so the\nflagged API is not reachable here; this pins ahead of it rather than chasing an\nexploit path. v5 adds an `exports` map, but nothing deep-imports the package,\nso the bare specifier keeps resolving.\n\nVerified against the real project files in both apps with 5.7.0 installed:\n- getMainActivity(AndroidManifest.xml)      -> \".MainActivity\"\n- getBuildConfigurationFromXcScheme(...)    -> \"Debug\" (not the fallback)\n- contents.xcworkspacedata FileRef parse    -> both xcodeproj locations\n\n`npm audit` in both apps no longer reports fast-xml-parser.","tree":{"sha":"02e5f6221b67d8cd0a27ad28de5f0c813b0387fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/trees/02e5f6221b67d8cd0a27ad28de5f0c813b0387fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/commits/6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da","node_id":"C_kwDOTTIIINoAKDZhNzkzMzMxYjhmZTVkYzQzMjJmMzM0ZjcyNjdjYTg1NmI0NjQzZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/a36f2d47eaca189249243f474208e52db0d6c0d6","sha":"a36f2d47eaca189249243f474208e52db0d6c0d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/a36f2d47eaca189249243f474208e52db0d6c0d6"}],"sha":"6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/6a793331b8fe5dc4322f334f7267ca856b4643da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/a36f2d47eaca189249243f474208e52db0d6c0d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T10:59:52Z","email":"brahimvall.boumouzouna@etu.fstm.ac.ma","name":"Brahim Vall Boumouzouna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:07:58Z","email":"92952971+BoumouzounaBrahimVall@users.noreply.github.com","name":"BOUMOUZOUNA BRAHIM VALL"},"message":"fix(deps): pin uuid 11.1.1 in playground-expo to clear GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq\n\nDependabot alert #1 (medium): uuid < 11.1.1 misses a buffer bounds check in\nv3/v5/v6 when a `buf` argument is supplied.\n\nThe vulnerable copy is uuid@7.0.3, pulled in transitively by xcode@3.0.1\n(`uuid: ^7.0.3`), which `expo prebuild` uses to generate the iOS project.\nThere is no 7.x backport, so the only route is an override — same approach\nalready used here for js-yaml/nanoid/postcss/brace-expansion.\n\nxcode''s only use of the package is `require(''uuid'').v4()`, which uuid 11\nstill exports from CJS, so the override is API-compatible. Verified locally\nagainst the real project file: parseSync, generateUuid (24-char pbxproj id),\ngetFirstTarget, and writeSync all round-trip unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"566170581141b1fba482835a0f6b6bc7018c7d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/trees/566170581141b1fba482835a0f6b6bc7018c7d86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/commits/a36f2d47eaca189249243f474208e52db0d6c0d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_