events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/fe9d9156303c1a4dfe0c8a12a8db21a6556e884b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T19:59:06Z","email":"brahimvall.boumouzouna@etu.fstm.ac.ma","name":"Brahim Vall Boumouzouna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:09:14Z","email":"92952971+BoumouzounaBrahimVall@users.noreply.github.com","name":"BOUMOUZOUNA BRAHIM VALL"},"message":"fix(deps): pin playground-expo transitives via overrides instead of audit fix\n\n`npm audit fix` swept the whole Expo train (57.0.4 -> 57.0.12, including\nexpo-modules-jsi 57.0.1 -> 57.0.4) to patch four transitive advisories, and\nthat broke expo-ios in CI: the ExpoModulesJSI xcframework script phase failed\nwith a clang frontend crash. A control run of the same workflow on unmodified\nmain passed with an identical cold Pods cache and the same Xcode 26.3 /\nSwift 6.2.4, which ruled out cache and toolchain drift.\n\nRevert the lockfile to main and force just the four vulnerable packages\nthrough `overrides`, leaving every Expo and React Native version where main\nhas it. Diff against main is now exactly four patch bumps with zero churn in\nexpo/react-native/metro/hermes.","tree":{"sha":"2c76372ed41075868d538ea3af65155e4a2ca023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/trees/2c76372ed41075868d538ea3af65155e4a2ca023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/commits/fe9d9156303c1a4dfe0c8a12a8db21a6556e884b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/fe9d9156303c1a4dfe0c8a12a8db21a6556e884b","node_id":"C_kwDOTTIIINoAKGZlOWQ5MTU2MzAzYzFhNGRmZTBjOGExMmE4ZGIyMWE2NTU2ZTg4NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commit/dd90de163078a56c72a73f52c76151dda2fbc830","sha":"dd90de163078a56c72a73f52c76151dda2fbc830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/dd90de163078a56c72a73f52c76151dda2fbc830"}],"sha":"fe9d9156303c1a4dfe0c8a12a8db21a6556e884b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/fe9d9156303c1a4dfe0c8a12a8db21a6556e884b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/commits/dd90de163078a56c72a73f52c76151dda2fbc830/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T19:38:20Z","email":"brahimvall.boumouzouna@etu.fstm.ac.ma","name":"Brahim Vall Boumouzouna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:09:14Z","email":"92952971+BoumouzounaBrahimVall@users.noreply.github.com","name":"BOUMOUZOUNA BRAHIM VALL"},"message":"fix(deps): resolve Dependabot security alerts without breaking changes\n\nLockfile-only transitive bumps (no manifest range changes, so no API risk\nto the published packages):\n\n- postcss 8.5.16 -> 8.5.26 (GHSA-r28c-9q8g-f849, GHSA-fxqj-rqcc-2cmp)\n- fast-uri 3.1.3 -> 3.1.5 (GHSA-7p8r-x3mc-p8w7, GHSA-v2hh-gcrm-f6hx)\n- js-yaml 4.3.0 -> 4.3.1, 3.15.0 -> 3.15.1 (GHSA-5p4m-2wfm-xmqj)\n- nanoid 3.3.15 -> 3.3.18 (GHSA-28wg-ghj8-5hjv)\n- brace-expansion 5.0.7 -> 5.0.9, 1.1.16 -> 1.1.18 (GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg,\n  GHSA-rgw5-rvv9-x895)\n\nGemfiles: drop the obsolete `concurrent-ruby < 1.3.4` pin from the RN\ntemplate (it guarded ActiveSupport < 7.1; we resolve 7.2 and depend on\n`logger` explicitly) and bump concurrent-ruby 1.3.3 -> 1.3.8 and\njson 2.20.0 -> 2.21.2. `pod env` verified on both apps.\n\nThe demo apps stayed on `npm audit fix` without `--force`, which would\nhave downgraded Expo 57 -> 53. No major version moved in any lockfile.\n\nStill open upstream, no safe fix available:\n- image-size: every published version incl. latest 2.0.2 is vulnerable and\n  metro requires ^1.0.2. Build-time only, never shipped by our packages.\n- fast-xml-parser 4.5.7: patched only in 5.7.0, a major bump inside the RN\n  community CLI. Build-time only.\n- uuid 7.0.3 via xcode: advisory needs the `buf` argument on v3/v5/v6;\n  xcode only calls v4, so the path is unreachable.\n\nAdd .github/dependabot.yml so those land automatically once upstream ships\na patch, and ignore vendored gems in .prettierignore (untracked locally,\nbreaks format:check but never seen by CI).","tree":{"sha":"0aa8d8e24b9a0e7a4de96906e19f59543bddd7d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/trees/0aa8d8e24b9a0e7a4de96906e19f59543bddd7d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/openmini/git/commits/dd90de163078a56c72a73f52c76151dda2fbc830","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92952971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BoumouzounaBrahimVall","id":92952971,"login":"BoumouzounaBrahimVall","node_id":"U_kgDOBYpZiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoumouzounaBrahimVall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api