"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniplexity-AI/absa-foundry-frontend/commits/780d3112773d0f3fb8bf3c3e6be4ada2fb363d76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T18:54:04Z","email":"kondwaninyirenda99@gmail.com","name":"kondwani0099"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T18:54:04Z","email":"kondwaninyirenda99@gmail.com","name":"kondwani0099"},"message":"chore(frontend): rebuild dist and commit pending CRM, ingest-edit and settings work\n\ndist/: full rebuild — the tracked bundle was stale by ~16h with its asset files half-deleted, so it no longer matched src.\n\nEditCustomerModal (new): saves through PATCH /api/v1/ingest/customer instead of the full-row POST upsert. The upsert wrote every column from the submitted form, so a partially filled form nulled the fields it did not carry. Only non-empty fields are now sent.\n\ningestApi.js: add getCustomerMaster() (pre-fill) and patchCustomer() (partial update), both via the existing _handleRes error handling.\n\nCustomerProfile.vue: track and display profile-API errors. A failing GET /customers/{id}/profile used to be swallowed by console.warn, leaving the page silently rendering snapshot-only fallback data with no identity facts.\n\ncustomerStore.js / MyCustomers.vue: pending portfolio and list updates.\n\nCRM: PromiseToFundReport view, crmApi service and components/crm (EngagementModal, PostEngagementPerformance).\n\nAlso commits pending auth, router, v-role, DashboardLayout and settings updates.\n\nNOTE: .env is deliberately not committed — it holds a local VITE_API_BASE_URL override (localhost) that would break the shared backend URL for other environments.","tree":{"sha":"9d56d3fccbfdf7afff5218db392596e401813999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniplexity-AI/absa-foundry-frontend/git/trees/9d56d3fccbfdf7afff5218db392596e401813999"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniplexity-AI/absa-foundry-frontend/git/commits/780d3112773d0f3fb8bf3c3e6be4ada2fb363d76","verification":{"payload"