ns_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-review/commits/3be7776ee6ec54cbdc2be238a9badc21d95fda9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T10:21:03Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T10:21:03Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"1.5.0: read-only reviewers via a gated system-session action\n\nWrites now go through one Java Action (reviewAction) that performs them\nin a system session, so any authenticated user who can READ a page can\ncomment - including read-only reviewers with no JCR write. Hybrid JS+Java\nbundle.\n\nGated per the jahia-security-scan lesson (unscoped elevation is the risk):\n- rejects guest; target node comes from the request URL (caller must read it)\n- every client comment id validated under <target>/reviewComments before write\n- only creates rvw:comment/jnt:task under computed paths\n- author recorded from the authenticated request user (non-spoofable)\n- delete restricted to the comment author; CSRF whitelist for *.reviewAction.do\n\nRemoves the 1.4.0 grantRoles ACL workaround (system session handles\ncross-user writes). Author identity moves to the server-set author prop.\nVerified: addComment via .do records author=<caller>/createdBy=system;\nscope guard rejects a cross-page comment id; drawer flow works.","tree":{"sha":"41fbad649fdd81a61d84f493d3be0669fae0c571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-review/git/trees/41fbad649fdd81a61d84f493d3be0669fae0c571"},"url":"https://a